(1132592, 139746, 31720, '<td valign="top">Good concept, although the position of the in-focus field could have been worked better.  For example, having the bottom of the disk stack in focus with the top out of focus would imply an immeasurably tall stack.  Reversing this arrangement and having the bottom of the stack fade to blur would seem like a row of disks that recedes over the horizon.  Just a couple of suggestions.</td>', 'Good concept, although the position of the in-focus field could have been worked better.  For example, having the bottom of the disk stack in focus with the top out of focus would imply an immeasurably tall stack.  Reversing this arrangement and having the bottom of the stack fade to blur would seem like a row of disks that recedes over the horizon.  Just a couple of suggestions.', '2005-01-26 03:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1132594, 139834, 31720, '<td valign="top">I like the metaphor for relationships in this picture (I''m thinking the young having to take care of the old since it looks like the newer hammer is carrying the older, cradling it without arms).  Very good.</td>', 'I like the metaphor for relationships in this picture (I''m thinking the young having to take care of the old since it looks like the newer hammer is carrying the older, cradling it without arms).  Very good.', '2005-01-26 03:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
