(1132610, 139351, 31720, '<td valign="top">If not for the slightly over-soft focus on the branch and the slight overexposure on the flowers, this would be a 10.  I give it a 9.</td>', 'If not for the slightly over-soft focus on the branch and the slight overexposure on the flowers, this would be a 10.  I give it a 9.', '2005-01-26 03:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
