(1132630, 138120, 28619, '<td valign="top">Nice idea but looks like a snapshot.<br/> <br/>The dog doesn''t add anything to the theme and the leaves in the foreground are distracting.  The highlights behind the fence are way too blown out and there is too much grass at the bottom.  One of the mowers is also cropped out.<br/> <br/>This may have been better if taken later in the day when the light wasn''t so harsh and with more thought given to composition.</td>', 'Nice idea but looks like a snapshot. The dog doesn''t add anything to the theme and the leaves in the foreground are distracting.  The highlights behind the fence are way too blown out and there is too much grass at the bottom.  One of the mowers is also cropped out. This may have been better if taken later in the day when the light wasn''t so harsh and with more thought given to composition.', '2005-01-26 04:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
