(1132774, 138804, 31720, '<td valign="top">I would like this picture a lot more if there was only one light source.  The interfering shadows messes up the image for me.  Still, I give it a 7.</td>', 'I would like this picture a lot more if there was only one light source.  The interfering shadows messes up the image for me.  Still, I give it a 7.', '2005-01-26 06:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1132778, 139617, 31720, '<td valign="top">Yes, the iPod is new and the mirror is old, but I don''t see why they are related.  In other words, why are they in the picture together?</td>', 'Yes, the iPod is new and the mirror is old, but I don''t see why they are related.  In other words, why are they in the picture together?', '2005-01-26 06:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1132780, 138003, 31720, '<td valign="top">Even though I''m partial to pencils that need to be sharpened, I really like this picture.</td>', 'Even though I''m partial to pencils that need to be sharpened, I really like this picture.', '2005-01-26 06:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1132782, 139985, 32325, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast....the older building looks warm and bold next to the cold and brittle glass facade.</td>', 'Nice contrast....the older building looks warm and bold next to the cold and brittle glass facade.', '2005-01-26 06:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1132783, 138216, 31720, '<td valign="top">So you''re saying that fountain pen users have a lack of ''ctrl'' over the ink?  I think using a keyboard of a different color than the background would make it more distinguishable.  Otherwise, good picture.</td>', 'So you''re saying that fountain pen users have a lack of ''ctrl'' over the ink?  I think using a keyboard of a different color than the background would make it more distinguishable.  Otherwise, good picture.', '2005-01-26 06:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1132786, 138031, 32325, '<td valign="top">Well done.</td>', 'Well done.', '2005-01-26 07:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1132787, 139093, 31720, '<td valign="top">Judging by the reflections off the slick, new bindings I''m guessing that there was light coming in from behind the camera (or from the flash).  This light needs to be removed so that it doesn''t obscure any of the titles.  Other than that, I like this picture and its message.</td>', 'Judging by the reflections off the slick, new bindings I''m guessing that there was light coming in from behind the camera (or from the flash).  This light needs to be removed so that it doesn''t obscure any of the titles.  Other than that, I like this picture and its message.', '2005-01-26 07:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1132788, 139292, 18349, '<td valign="top">What an innovative idea!  I think the main detractor with this shot will be lighting and noise, but the idea itself and the emotive nature are it''s saving graces.  Neat!  :o)</td>', 'What an innovative idea!  I think the main detractor with this shot will be lighting and noise, but the idea itself and the emotive nature are it''s saving graces.  Neat!  :o)', '2005-01-26 07:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
