(1132918, 139921, 31319, '<td valign="top">Very powerful  juxtaposition of drab, run-down old and glittery new.  I think the composition  could have been improved by cropping hard on the left side up to the tree in the foreground.  The back porch and vehicle clutter are sore distractions from the building comparisons.  Excellent choice and good eye for this challenge though..</td>', 'Very powerful  juxtaposition of drab, run-down old and glittery new.  I think the composition  could have been improved by cropping hard on the left side up to the tree in the foreground.  The back porch and vehicle clutter are sore distractions from the building comparisons.  Excellent choice and good eye for this challenge though..', '2005-01-26 08:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
