(1133299, 139993, 18868, '<td valign="top">over-sharpened for web.  I find that images with lots of small, bright highlights benefit from raising the value of the "threshold".  It allows you to sharpen with an eye to the rest of the image.  Do a search on the DPC threads -- there has been some discussion about unsharp masking that is worth reading.</td>', 'over-sharpened for web.  I find that images with lots of small, bright highlights benefit from raising the value of the "threshold".  It allows you to sharpen with an eye to the rest of the image.  Do a search on the DPC threads -- there has been some discussion about unsharp masking that is worth reading.', '2005-01-26 12:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
