(1133337, 138827, 31323, '<td valign="top">nice pic, but it isn''t really in line with the challenge. There is no juxtapositioning of old and new.  If there was I would definately score it around a 6 or 7.</td>', 'nice pic, but it isn''t really in line with the challenge. There is no juxtapositioning of old and new.  If there was I would definately score it around a 6 or 7.', '2005-01-26 13:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133339, 138031, 32672, '<td valign="top">creative and applicable to the theme of this entire site.  A bit blurred, but the idea certianly sure is neat.</td>', 'creative and applicable to the theme of this entire site.  A bit blurred, but the idea certianly sure is neat.', '2005-01-26 13:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133340, 138824, 31323, '<td valign="top">That old penny really stands out. Great photo!</td>', 'That old penny really stands out. Great photo!', '2005-01-26 13:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133341, 139307, 31323, '<td valign="top">This is a great picture, but there isn''t really any comparison between old and new in this one. I love the color tone by the way.</td>', 'This is a great picture, but there isn''t really any comparison between old and new in this one. I love the color tone by the way.', '2005-01-26 13:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133343, 139617, 18868, '<td valign="top">The orange tint is excessive.  If you could keep the iPod white (or at least mostly white) that would improve the image.  If you built the image using photoshops duotone function, adjustment of the curves will achieve this.  Also, it seems as if there is a lot of detail in the photo, but it could use a touch more unsharp maksing for web viewing.</td>', 'The orange tint is excessive.  If you could keep the iPod white (or at least mostly white) that would improve the image.  If you built the image using photoshops duotone function, adjustment of the curves will achieve this.  Also, it seems as if there is a lot of detail in the photo, but it could use a touch more unsharp maksing for web viewing.', '2005-01-26 13:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133344, 139655, 30787, '<td valign="top">Not old and new. 2</td>', 'Not old and new. 2', '2005-01-26 13:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133346, 138603, 31323, '<td valign="top">no comparison between old and new in this one.</td>', 'no comparison between old and new in this one.', '2005-01-26 13:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
