(1133358, 139944, 18868, '<td valign="top">Good concept, the books could be closer together.  I''m asuming the swirly stuff is supposed to be smoke from the smoking gun?  Hard to simulate, harder to shoot.</td>', 'Good concept, the books could be closer together.  I''m asuming the swirly stuff is supposed to be smoke from the smoking gun?  Hard to simulate, harder to shoot.', '2005-01-26 13:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133363, 138702, 28379, '<td valign="top">Lacks Imagination!</td>', 'Lacks Imagination!', '2005-01-26 13:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133364, 139678, 18868, '<td valign="top">If your camera has a white balance setting, using the "indoor" or "tungsten" setting will improve the image -- notice how the whites on the label, milk &amp; table cloth have a pinkish cast?  The WB setting will fix that.  Perhaps a bit more sharpening for web viewing as well.  Awesome concept!</td>', 'If your camera has a white balance setting, using the "indoor" or "tungsten" setting will improve the image -- notice how the whites on the label, milk & table cloth have a pinkish cast?  The WB setting will fix that.  Perhaps a bit more sharpening for web viewing as well.  Awesome concept!', '2005-01-26 13:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133365, 139542, 18868, '<td valign="top">The selective color really doesn''t work and is really over-done in any case -- perhaps a duotone would have been a better choice.</td>', 'The selective color really doesn''t work and is really over-done in any case -- perhaps a duotone would have been a better choice.', '2005-01-26 13:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
