(1133398, 139555, 10658, '<td valign="top">I like the depth of focus here.  The only thing I might change would be to wipe off the fingerprints on the "new" watch :)  Other than that it''s really good.  Very nice texture and the colors are wonderful.  I like the crop a lot too.  With just a little polishing that could be a magazine ad.  Very nice!</td>', 'I like the depth of focus here.  The only thing I might change would be to wipe off the fingerprints on the "new" watch :)  Other than that it''s really good.  Very nice texture and the colors are wonderful.  I like the crop a lot too.  With just a little polishing that could be a magazine ad.  Very nice!', '2005-01-26 13:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133401, 139224, 10658, '<td valign="top">Pure brilliance here!  The colors are excellent, perfect subject for the challenge, I love your composition, etc.  This''ll be the first (only?) 10 I give.</td>', 'Pure brilliance here!  The colors are excellent, perfect subject for the challenge, I love your composition, etc.  This''ll be the first (only?) 10 I give.', '2005-01-26 13:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
