(1133757, 139990, 31717, '<td valign="top">I do not understan where new and old are represented in this picture. The only connection I can make is between the quartz like stones a and the glass they could/will become but I think if that was the case your title should have reflected glass or quartz and not specifically the "martini glass."</td>', 'I do not understan where new and old are represented in this picture. The only connection I can make is between the quartz like stones a and the glass they could/will become but I think if that was the case your title should have reflected glass or quartz and not specifically the "martini glass."', '2005-01-26 17:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
