(1133763, 139483, 31133, '<td valign="top">Nice idea for this with the mushrooms, but it looks like the focus hit the blades of grass just to the lower right and on the left side of the big mushroom. I like how you can see the dew, but it would''ve been lots better if the old mushroom especially got some of the good focus that the grass got.</td>', 'Nice idea for this with the mushrooms, but it looks like the focus hit the blades of grass just to the lower right and on the left side of the big mushroom. I like how you can see the dew, but it would''ve been lots better if the old mushroom especially got some of the good focus that the grass got.', '2005-01-26 17:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
