(1133780, 139624, 31133, '<td valign="top">I love the title and the theme. I also like the composition, but there''s something missing - don''t know what it is. Maybe the electrical outlet is too distracting, and maybe if the picture  were cropped (and not sepia), then we could focus more on the candle and that shot of beautiful smoke you managed to capture.</td>', 'I love the title and the theme. I also like the composition, but there''s something missing - don''t know what it is. Maybe the electrical outlet is too distracting, and maybe if the picture  were cropped (and not sepia), then we could focus more on the candle and that shot of beautiful smoke you managed to capture.', '2005-01-26 17:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
