(1133786, 139615, 31133, '<td valign="top">Is it spring already where you live?! Lucky you. I think this is beautiful. A bit too much light on the snowdrops for my taste. I say that because some of them are glowing, but that might be what you were after here. I think the foreground leaf is the best part! 5</td>', 'Is it spring already where you live?! Lucky you. I think this is beautiful. A bit too much light on the snowdrops for my taste. I say that because some of them are glowing, but that might be what you were after here. I think the foreground leaf is the best part! 5', '2005-01-26 17:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133792, 139084, 31133, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but I don''t get how this is past and present (possibly because it''s an older camera taken with a new one?). The top half of the shot is good, but it looks like the lower left is a tad washed out. Black and white was a great choice here!</td>', 'I''m sorry, but I don''t get how this is past and present (possibly because it''s an older camera taken with a new one?). The top half of the shot is good, but it looks like the lower left is a tad washed out. Black and white was a great choice here!', '2005-01-26 17:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133794, 139351, 29537, '<td valign="top">I love the subject, the colors, the DOF and the bhoken</td>', 'I love the subject, the colors, the DOF and the bhoken', '2005-01-26 17:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
