(1133802, 138827, 31133, '<td valign="top">What a brilliant idea!  You show us the feelings of past and present instead of the literal juxtoposition. The bubbles are absolutely beautiful. There''s something about the building  (or maybe it''s the background light at the top) that fights with them, though, and that lowered the score a little. Now that I look longer, I think if the very top were cropped it would be really, really fantastic.</td>', 'What a brilliant idea!  You show us the feelings of past and present instead of the literal juxtoposition. The bubbles are absolutely beautiful. There''s something about the building  (or maybe it''s the background light at the top) that fights with them, though, and that lowered the score a little. Now that I look longer, I think if the very top were cropped it would be really, really fantastic.', '2005-01-26 17:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
