(1133812, 139954, 31133, '<td valign="top">I love the candle and its colors - the glow on it is beautiful. I don''t understand what that big blue and white disk is, but maybe I''m just dense. The answer probably explains the old and new part of the challenge. Well, I do really like that candle and the black background.</td>', 'I love the candle and its colors - the glow on it is beautiful. I don''t understand what that big blue and white disk is, but maybe I''m just dense. The answer probably explains the old and new part of the challenge. Well, I do really like that candle and the black background.', '2005-01-26 17:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
