(1134487, 139673, 31403, '<td valign="top">when you don''t crop, I can see that you didn''t even stop to take the time to compose this.  I would suggest cropping in on that new palm in the middle of the old, and crop the palm off center.  Then it has some composition that I can get excited about.</td>', 'when you don''t crop, I can see that you didn''t even stop to take the time to compose this.  I would suggest cropping in on that new palm in the middle of the old, and crop the palm off center.  Then it has some composition that I can get excited about.', '2005-01-26 23:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134491, 139593, 31403, '<td valign="top">terrific idea!  did you try B/W?  I''ll bet it looks great that way too.  I''d also try cropping just to the big finger and little hand, I think that would be a stronger image.</td>', 'terrific idea!  did you try B/W?  I''ll bet it looks great that way too.  I''d also try cropping just to the big finger and little hand, I think that would be a stronger image.', '2005-01-26 23:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134499, 139542, 31403, '<td valign="top">this is too obvious.  I feel like you have no faith in your audience, so you underline the point in red.  Instead of going all the way to sepia in the rest of the image, maybe just subtley scale back on the saturation to make the bridge "pop", but without beating me over the head with it.  Subtle is the key word for effect work.</td>', 'this is too obvious.  I feel like you have no faith in your audience, so you underline the point in red.  Instead of going all the way to sepia in the rest of the image, maybe just subtley scale back on the saturation to make the bridge "pop", but without beating me over the head with it.  Subtle is the key word for effect work.', '2005-01-26 23:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
