(1134595, 139546, 22537, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge and a pleasant photo to look at.  I see a slight sharpness problem but it is very slight.  Good capture and good luck.</td>', 'Meets the challenge and a pleasant photo to look at.  I see a slight sharpness problem but it is very slight.  Good capture and good luck.', '2005-01-27 00:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134600, 139749, 22537, '<td valign="top">I look at this shot and each time I like it more. At first it was just really good and then when I noticed the wind farm in the background, the full impact hit.The shift from light to dark and the contrast in the subjects makes this a winner in my books.  I''m saying you''ve got yourself a ribbon.</td>', 'I look at this shot and each time I like it more. At first it was just really good and then when I noticed the wind farm in the background, the full impact hit.The shift from light to dark and the contrast in the subjects makes this a winner in my books.  I''m saying you''ve got yourself a ribbon.', '2005-01-27 00:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134601, 138808, 22537, '<td valign="top">Yes....another boring pen shot but no!  This got high marks from me because of the splatter.  A simple thing as that has made this shot one of my top picks.  You have definitely captured my interest.  Top 10.</td>', 'Yes....another boring pen shot but no!  This got high marks from me because of the splatter.  A simple thing as that has made this shot one of my top picks.  You have definitely captured my interest.  Top 10.', '2005-01-27 00:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134604, 139976, 22537, '<td valign="top">Very clever.  Of course we have the contrasting writing instruments but I think it is impressive that you did not write anything but rather you doodled.  This has made the shot interesting.  Great imagination and good luck.</td>', 'Very clever.  Of course we have the contrasting writing instruments but I think it is impressive that you did not write anything but rather you doodled.  This has made the shot interesting.  Great imagination and good luck.', '2005-01-27 00:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
