(1134839, 138618, 27524, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture but i dont really get what you ment as new. Wonder if it would look more interesting in b&amp;w.</td>', 'Interesting picture but i dont really get what you ment as new. Wonder if it would look more interesting in b&w.', '2005-01-27 05:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
