(1134842, 138928, 27524, '<td valign="top">You found real  nice mix of old and new. Halfdesaturation is nice too...but i think i would choose bit different angle of capture. Also i dont think that blue frame fit here well.</td>', 'You found real  nice mix of old and new. Halfdesaturation is nice too...but i think i would choose bit different angle of capture. Also i dont think that blue frame fit here well.', '2005-01-27 05:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
