(1134846, 138214, 30018, '<td valign="top">Perception...funny thing, it is.  Had I chosen this theme, the CD would have been the "New", while an old ''45 record'' would have been the "old"&gt;  Now you''re making me feel old.  Photo is nicely done.  I love the reflection idea.  That is very powerful.  8</td>', 'Perception...funny thing, it is.  Had I chosen this theme, the CD would have been the "New", while an old ''45 record'' would have been the "old">  Now you''re making me feel old.  Photo is nicely done.  I love the reflection idea.  That is very powerful.  8', '2005-01-27 05:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134847, 138015, 30896, '<td valign="top">i like such couples but i would prefer the tower''s peak  to be in the picture, or st else to add depth</td>', 'i like such couples but i would prefer the tower''s peak  to be in the picture, or st else to add depth', '2005-01-27 05:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134849, 138806, 17047, '<td valign="top">An Australian! That''s worth an extra point ;-)</td>', 'An Australian! That''s worth an extra point ;-)', '2005-01-27 05:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134855, 138819, 30018, '<td valign="top">When I thought about this challenge, I thought of about 20 different ideas, and each and everyone of them have been represented here.  This, however, is one I did not think of.  I like this.  Good going.  8</td>', 'When I thought about this challenge, I thought of about 20 different ideas, and each and everyone of them have been represented here.  This, however, is one I did not think of.  I like this.  Good going.  8', '2005-01-27 05:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134863, 139706, 31720, '<td valign="top">I think it would have been more effective if the DVD and the book were related, perhaps using "The Time Machine."  The fold in the page is unfortunate.</td>', 'I think it would have been more effective if the DVD and the book were related, perhaps using "The Time Machine."  The fold in the page is unfortunate.', '2005-01-27 06:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
