(1134995, 138344, 30584, '<td valign="top">some people may tell you this is a snapshot, but snapshots are real (not created in a studio) and hard to get right (light, focus etc)..well done! And b&amp;w bring the focus onto the faces, rather than the colors I imagine are on the cake and such.</td>', 'some people may tell you this is a snapshot, but snapshots are real (not created in a studio) and hard to get right (light, focus etc)..well done! And b&w bring the focus onto the faces, rather than the colors I imagine are on the cake and such.', '2005-01-27 08:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
