(1135080, 139964, 32695, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice photo, I love roses! And the fresh rose is gorgeous while the dying rose is still pretty.  The background is perfect because it does not take anything away from the roses.  They stand out.</td>', 'This is a really nice photo, I love roses! And the fresh rose is gorgeous while the dying rose is still pretty.  The background is perfect because it does not take anything away from the roses.  They stand out.', '2005-01-27 10:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
