(1135087, 138003, 32695, '<td valign="top">I like this photo...it looks very digital.  I like the way the pencil is broken over the pen.  It is a very creatice idea!  Plus the background or the drawing is neat too...its brings out the focus of the picture.</td>', 'I like this photo...it looks very digital.  I like the way the pencil is broken over the pen.  It is a very creatice idea!  Plus the background or the drawing is neat too...its brings out the focus of the picture.', '2005-01-27 10:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135089, 139749, 32695, '<td valign="top">The is a very mysterious picture.. the setting is very rural but pretty at the same time.  I like the way the color gives it a very gloomy look.  In the back of the picture you see broken twigs but i think they are telephone poles that are very old which is neat because it shows how old the setting is!</td>', 'The is a very mysterious picture.. the setting is very rural but pretty at the same time.  I like the way the color gives it a very gloomy look.  In the back of the picture you see broken twigs but i think they are telephone poles that are very old which is neat because it shows how old the setting is!', '2005-01-27 10:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135127, 139554, 31820, '<td valign="top">The red light just add''s the right touch, well done</td>', 'The red light just add''s the right touch, well done', '2005-01-27 11:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
