(1135377, 140009, 32132, '<td valign="top">The best of the building reflections.....Yours has a nice hue, and composition. I really like it, building photos don''t usually inspire me! Thanks.</td>', 'The best of the building reflections.....Yours has a nice hue, and composition. I really like it, building photos don''t usually inspire me! Thanks.', '2005-01-27 15:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
