(1135386, 138896, 31443, '<td valign="top">Ouch!</td>', 'Ouch!', '2005-01-27 15:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135387, 140008, 32132, '<td valign="top">I like the continuity of the lighting, with the relative natural, seemingly candid capture. Balanced, beautiful...for the family: Precious &amp; Priceless. 10</td>', 'I like the continuity of the lighting, with the relative natural, seemingly candid capture. Balanced, beautiful...for the family: Precious & Priceless. 10', '2005-01-27 15:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135391, 138623, 32132, '<td valign="top">Emotional. This image does what I believe is the heart of photography, it conveys feeling.  When you look at it and the technique is an afterthought.  Most photos I go down the checklist....subject, focus, comp., color, lighting, contrast...etc.; but with this one I like it and feel it FIRST, then as I study it I discover why: the message, the gritty texture, subtle color variation(low saturation)..all of those compliment each other (and work together) to make this image not just a photo...but Art.  Nice job, 10.</td>', 'Emotional. This image does what I believe is the heart of photography, it conveys feeling.  When you look at it and the technique is an afterthought.  Most photos I go down the checklist....subject, focus, comp., color, lighting, contrast...etc.; but with this one I like it and feel it FIRST, then as I study it I discover why: the message, the gritty texture, subtle color variation(low saturation)..all of those compliment each other (and work together) to make this image not just a photo...but Art.  Nice job, 10.', '2005-01-27 15:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135392, 139917, 31443, '<td valign="top">I like this photo but would have chosen other than the polyesterin background gives the composition impression of overexposure...</td>', 'I like this photo but would have chosen other than the polyesterin background gives the composition impression of overexposure...', '2005-01-27 15:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135393, 139292, 31637, '<td valign="top">good luck David...a 7</td>', 'good luck David...a 7', '2005-01-27 15:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135394, 139213, 32132, '<td valign="top">Just lovely! The sky, the color of the buildings...aged and golden vs. pristine and perfect white....the more I look at it the happier I feel! I say 9!  Any pointers for me? I can get the lights to magically star....but the sky?</td>', 'Just lovely! The sky, the color of the buildings...aged and golden vs. pristine and perfect white....the more I look at it the happier I feel! I say 9!  Any pointers for me? I can get the lights to magically star....but the sky?', '2005-01-27 15:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135395, 139960, 31637, '<td valign="top">noisy...</td>', 'noisy...', '2005-01-27 15:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135396, 139981, 32132, '<td valign="top">I just like this photo, it appeals to me in a way that is hard to explain. The simplicity of nature, well captured.  This image has you forgetting about composition, contrast, etc. (they are all good, But...) the long shadows, the blury old oak in the background gives \\\"meaning\\\" and mood. Wow, the more I look at it the more I like it. Exceeds the challenge. One of 3  \"10\"s from me.</td>', 'I just like this photo, it appeals to me in a way that is hard to explain. The simplicity of nature, well captured.  This image has you forgetting about composition, contrast, etc. (they are all good, But...) the long shadows, the blury old oak in the background gives \\\"meaning\\\" and mood. Wow, the more I look at it the more I like it. Exceeds the challenge. One of 3  \"10\"s from me.', '2005-01-27 15:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135397, 139824, 31637, '<td valign="top">this is the 5th grapes photo Ive seen...yours is the best but not too creative</td>', 'this is the 5th grapes photo Ive seen...yours is the best but not too creative', '2005-01-27 15:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
