(1135447, 139832, 23583, '<td valign="top">Good thing I don''t stlil live in Boston, or we both would have submitted this photo. :)  I like the shadows... (that glare in the bottom left and the two lights inside the Hancock must have been frustrating).</td>', 'Good thing I don''t stlil live in Boston, or we both would have submitted this photo. :)  I like the shadows... (that glare in the bottom left and the two lights inside the Hancock must have been frustrating).', '2005-01-27 16:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135454, 139749, 23583, '<td valign="top">I like the subtlety of the windmills in the picture.  It may just be my monitor, but the tree  takes something away from the picture (in my opinion) because it obscures the building too much.  The darkness gives this great atmosphere.</td>', 'I like the subtlety of the windmills in the picture.  It may just be my monitor, but the tree  takes something away from the picture (in my opinion) because it obscures the building too much.  The darkness gives this great atmosphere.', '2005-01-27 16:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135464, 139546, 23583, '<td valign="top">The gherkin!  I''ve never been to London, but it seems like a great place to contrast old and new...  I think if you had gotten a little lower, you could have removed that distracting blue light just left of center above the castle.  Too bad the castle wasn''t lit with torches instead of electric lights. :)</td>', 'The gherkin!  I''ve never been to London, but it seems like a great place to contrast old and new...  I think if you had gotten a little lower, you could have removed that distracting blue light just left of center above the castle.  Too bad the castle wasn''t lit with torches instead of electric lights. :)', '2005-01-27 16:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135465, 139706, 23583, '<td valign="top">Is the DVD an H.G. Wells-based movie?</td>', 'Is the DVD an H.G. Wells-based movie?', '2005-01-27 16:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135470, 139817, 23583, '<td valign="top">Those triangles on the top of the glass building look like an evil jack-o-lantern. :)  Was there an angle that could have removed that building in-between and the one at the lower-right?</td>', 'Those triangles on the top of the glass building look like an evil jack-o-lantern. :)  Was there an angle that could have removed that building in-between and the one at the lower-right?', '2005-01-27 16:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135476, 139852, 31443, '<td valign="top">First wow! Looks like tapestry, love this photo, Camelia?</td>', 'First wow! Looks like tapestry, love this photo, Camelia?', '2005-01-27 16:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135477, 138411, 25041, '<td valign="top">this is a bit too small</td>', 'this is a bit too small', '2005-01-27 16:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135479, 138037, 23583, '<td valign="top">Most building reflection pictures I see don''t show the inside of the reflective building, like this one does...  in this case, it serves to make the reflected buildings more "ghostly," given them an even older feel.</td>', 'Most building reflection pictures I see don''t show the inside of the reflective building, like this one does...  in this case, it serves to make the reflected buildings more "ghostly," given them an even older feel.', '2005-01-27 16:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135481, 138214, 23583, '<td valign="top">Are we allowed to "flip" the picture for Basic Editing?  If not, taking a picture of this in a mirror would have made the iPod text go the right direction (though managing all of those reflections would have been difficult...)</td>', 'Are we allowed to "flip" the picture for Basic Editing?  If not, taking a picture of this in a mirror would have made the iPod text go the right direction (though managing all of those reflections would have been difficult...)', '2005-01-27 16:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135483, 138460, 31443, '<td valign="top">The colorless image of the grandmother makes this composition all the more meaningful, I like it a lot</td>', 'The colorless image of the grandmother makes this composition all the more meaningful, I like it a lot', '2005-01-27 16:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135501, 138841, 24615, '<td valign="top">I am new, so I may be wrong.  But, it looks like a flash was used which would produce the bright eyes and, the photo looks very blurry.  Otherwise, beautiful dogs.</td>', 'I am new, so I may be wrong.  But, it looks like a flash was used which would produce the bright eyes and, the photo looks very blurry.  Otherwise, beautiful dogs.', '2005-01-27 16:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135504, 138120, 24615, '<td valign="top">For me, the tree branch in the front is too distracting... but hey, gotta love those old mowers..</td>', 'For me, the tree branch in the front is too distracting... but hey, gotta love those old mowers..', '2005-01-27 16:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135515, 138031, 31036, '<td valign="top">Great idea and title. I would like to see a little more focus on the roll, though. Still, excellent photo.</td>', 'Great idea and title. I would like to see a little more focus on the roll, though. Still, excellent photo.', '2005-01-27 16:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135540, 138214, 32659, '<td valign="top">It would''ve been better if we could see on the iPod screen and on the CD what the album is, for a better comparison. Or have a picture that reflected how much more music could fit on an iPod versus a CD.</td>', 'It would''ve been better if we could see on the iPod screen and on the CD what the album is, for a better comparison. Or have a picture that reflected how much more music could fit on an iPod versus a CD.', '2005-01-27 17:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135552, 139923, 32041, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  I love the perspective.</td>', 'Great shot.  I love the perspective.', '2005-01-27 17:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135554, 138583, 32041, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  I find myself wondering through the picture, admiring the detail and the history.</td>', 'I really like this shot.  I find myself wondering through the picture, admiring the detail and the history.', '2005-01-27 17:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135556, 139515, 32041, '<td valign="top">Great shot.</td>', 'Great shot.', '2005-01-27 17:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135565, 139468, 23583, '<td valign="top">I like the apparent randomness of the change, and the different colors (with the dominant dark colors mostly in the middle, but also peeking out from some other places).  The little bit of missing space in the bottom right throws the picture off a little for me.  Was showing the reverse of the Connecticut quarter while showing mostly the obverse of other coins an intentional decision?</td>', 'I like the apparent randomness of the change, and the different colors (with the dominant dark colors mostly in the middle, but also peeking out from some other places).  The little bit of missing space in the bottom right throws the picture off a little for me.  Was showing the reverse of the Connecticut quarter while showing mostly the obverse of other coins an intentional decision?', '2005-01-27 17:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135566, 139818, 32659, '<td valign="top">Not sure if I totally understand the ''old'' and the ''new''. The tree trunk is old and the little cart made of wood is the new?</td>', 'Not sure if I totally understand the ''old'' and the ''new''. The tree trunk is old and the little cart made of wood is the new?', '2005-01-27 17:45:24.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1135573, 138806, 23583, '<td valign="top">I like the reflections in this picture.  There is some dust or stray reflections on the lower right of the image that literally had me blowing on my monitor to clean it off. :)</td>', 'I like the reflections in this picture.  There is some dust or stray reflections on the lower right of the image that literally had me blowing on my monitor to clean it off. :)', '2005-01-27 17:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135574, 138841, 32659, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the glare in the eyes, and there''s too many things laying around in the shot. A picture with just the dogs as main focus would be nice.</td>', 'I don''t like the glare in the eyes, and there''s too many things laying around in the shot. A picture with just the dogs as main focus would be nice.', '2005-01-27 17:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135577, 138974, 32659, '<td valign="top">I like the picture, but I think the theme could''ve been expressed better.</td>', 'I like the picture, but I think the theme could''ve been expressed better.', '2005-01-27 17:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135578, 139594, 23583, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why, but I get the feeling from this picture that the flower in the back is looking at the flower that has wilted and laughing. :)</td>', 'I don''t know why, but I get the feeling from this picture that the flower in the back is looking at the flower that has wilted and laughing. :)', '2005-01-27 17:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135581, 138841, 32762, '<td valign="top">Too much clutter around subjects</td>', 'Too much clutter around subjects', '2005-01-27 17:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135586, 139733, 23583, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.  (Maybe I have a natural affinity since "ro" are the first two letters of my last name. :))  The black stitches on the "ro" paper add an interesting texture.</td>', 'This is beautiful.  (Maybe I have a natural affinity since "ro" are the first two letters of my last name. :))  The black stitches on the "ro" paper add an interesting texture.', '2005-01-27 17:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135588, 139924, 24890, '<td valign="top">Good idea for the contest. However, the lighting is way too harsh. The picture seems to be way overexposed.</td>', 'Good idea for the contest. However, the lighting is way too harsh. The picture seems to be way overexposed.', '2005-01-27 17:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135590, 139655, 24890, '<td valign="top">How does this fit the old and new challenge? Is this an old horse that is new to you?</td>', 'How does this fit the old and new challenge? Is this an old horse that is new to you?', '2005-01-27 17:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135592, 138640, 24890, '<td valign="top">Great concept</td>', 'Great concept', '2005-01-27 17:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135593, 139766, 23583, '<td valign="top">It''s a little humbling to see someone have a much more creative take on a subject than I would have had.  I thought about taking a picture of an iPod in front of an LP, but would never have thought about spinning it like this.  Nice picture.</td>', 'It''s a little humbling to see someone have a much more creative take on a subject than I would have had.  I thought about taking a picture of an iPod in front of an LP, but would never have thought about spinning it like this.  Nice picture.', '2005-01-27 17:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135595, 138515, 24890, '<td valign="top">How does this fit the challenge of old and new??</td>', 'How does this fit the challenge of old and new??', '2005-01-27 17:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135598, 139882, 25355, '<td valign="top">Shouldn''t this be in the Ligt challenge?It would do fairly well.  I don''t see a juxtaposition btween old and new, or maybe it''s just too early in the morning.</td>', 'Shouldn''t this be in the Ligt challenge?It would do fairly well.  I don''t see a juxtaposition btween old and new, or maybe it''s just too early in the morning.', '2005-01-27 17:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135599, 139622, 24890, '<td valign="top">Ohhh.... I miss hockey!!!!  :) Good picture!</td>', 'Ohhh.... I miss hockey!!!!  :) Good picture!', '2005-01-27 17:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135606, 138168, 24890, '<td valign="top">Picture is too small.... Please check the site for the recommended sizing requirements.</td>', 'Picture is too small.... Please check the site for the recommended sizing requirements.', '2005-01-27 18:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135608, 139292, 23583, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept (it took me a second to realize the split you have in the letter).   The lighting feels a little off to me, though I see the thought you put into making the older part of the letter darker while brightening the newer part.  The bright white on the left and top is a bit too harsh.</td>', 'Interesting concept (it took me a second to realize the split you have in the letter).   The lighting feels a little off to me, though I see the thought you put into making the older part of the letter darker while brightening the newer part.  The bright white on the left and top is a bit too harsh.', '2005-01-27 18:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135610, 139990, 24890, '<td valign="top">I don''t get how this fits in the challenge... Maybe I am just missing it.</td>', 'I don''t get how this fits in the challenge... Maybe I am just missing it.', '2005-01-27 18:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135613, 139676, 24890, '<td valign="top">Picture is too small, please check the site recommendations for sizing, Also, from what I can tell there is only young boys in the photo. How does that fit into the challenge.</td>', 'Picture is too small, please check the site recommendations for sizing, Also, from what I can tell there is only young boys in the photo. How does that fit into the challenge.', '2005-01-27 18:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135618, 139617, 23583, '<td valign="top">These two objects seemed unrelated, until I remembered/noticed the mirrored background of the iPod.  I like the double reflection, the angle and the color.</td>', 'These two objects seemed unrelated, until I remembered/noticed the mirrored background of the iPod.  I like the double reflection, the angle and the color.', '2005-01-27 18:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135624, 139776, 24890, '<td valign="top">Picture is too small.  Check the sites recommendations for sizing.</td>', 'Picture is too small.  Check the sites recommendations for sizing.', '2005-01-27 18:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135625, 139944, 30818, '<td valign="top">It''s a sad world we live in</td>', 'It''s a sad world we live in', '2005-01-27 18:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135627, 139645, 28619, '<td valign="top">I think this will suffer due to the similarity with a high number of entries.<br/> <br/>On my monitor, the light looks too magenta to be a safe light used in a traditional darkroom which sort of spoils the effect for me.</td>', 'I think this will suffer due to the similarity with a high number of entries. On my monitor, the light looks too magenta to be a safe light used in a traditional darkroom which sort of spoils the effect for me.', '2005-01-27 18:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
