(1135633, 139307, 28619, '<td valign="top">Wow, great light, great shot, although I find the rock in the foreground a bit distracting<br/> <br/>What''s missing is a link to the theme which is a shame as I think this would have done really in another challenge.  I can see it scoring low because of this.</td>', 'Wow, great light, great shot, although I find the rock in the foreground a bit distracting What''s missing is a link to the theme which is a shame as I think this would have done really in another challenge.  I can see it scoring low because of this.', '2005-01-27 18:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135638, 138381, 24890, '<td valign="top">Love the composition and the framing. I have seen a couple of attempts at this idea and this is my favorite. (10)</td>', 'Love the composition and the framing. I have seen a couple of attempts at this idea and this is my favorite. (10)', '2005-01-27 18:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
