(1136143, 139940, 25218, '<td valign="top">You show a very distinct contrast between the old and the new! I also like the square crop. I don''t care much for the background color, and the composition isn''t wow-ing me, but who am I?</td>', 'You show a very distinct contrast between the old and the new! I also like the square crop. I don''t care much for the background color, and the composition isn''t wow-ing me, but who am I?', '2005-01-27 22:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136145, 139342, 25218, '<td valign="top">I like the high-key effect. As far as meeting the challenge, I''m not sure if there is enough difference between the old and new... they look about the same to me - maybe a different angle would show the age of the left shoe more?</td>', 'I like the high-key effect. As far as meeting the challenge, I''m not sure if there is enough difference between the old and new... they look about the same to me - maybe a different angle would show the age of the left shoe more?', '2005-01-27 22:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136147, 139185, 25218, '<td valign="top">You did very well on the composition, because my eye is lead directly to where the baby''s fingers are touching the wrinkled knuckles of the elder person. For a blk/wht photo, there isn''t enough variation in tone for my taste - it looks like maybe you used a flash, which has made everything in the foreground the same shade of grey.</td>', 'You did very well on the composition, because my eye is lead directly to where the baby''s fingers are touching the wrinkled knuckles of the elder person. For a blk/wht photo, there isn''t enough variation in tone for my taste - it looks like maybe you used a flash, which has made everything in the foreground the same shade of grey.', '2005-01-27 22:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136149, 138741, 25218, '<td valign="top">I like this. I''m not sure I understand the point of the money, but that''s probably just me. But the netting (or whatever) over the watch on the right, which gives it the feel of dusty spiderwebs, is a nice effect.  It''s a pleasing composition, also. 7</td>', 'I like this. I''m not sure I understand the point of the money, but that''s probably just me. But the netting (or whatever) over the watch on the right, which gives it the feel of dusty spiderwebs, is a nice effect.  It''s a pleasing composition, also. 7', '2005-01-27 22:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136151, 138015, 25218, '<td valign="top">Wow. That is close. Good observation.</td>', 'Wow. That is close. Good observation.', '2005-01-27 22:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136153, 139985, 25218, '<td valign="top">Very cool! I love how the lines of the 2 bldgs. meet, and the blue &amp; white coloring. Stunning!</td>', 'Very cool! I love how the lines of the 2 bldgs. meet, and the blue & white coloring. Stunning!', '2005-01-27 22:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136156, 139820, 25218, '<td valign="top">I''m having a hard time telling which one is old and which is new.  Oh, duh, the one on the left that''s not laced &amp; tied is new. Overall, this doesn''t wow me, but I like the sepia tone. 6</td>', 'I''m having a hard time telling which one is old and which is new.  Oh, duh, the one on the left that''s not laced & tied is new. Overall, this doesn''t wow me, but I like the sepia tone. 6', '2005-01-27 22:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136157, 139860, 25218, '<td valign="top">Great idea! The highlights on the new screws are a little glaring &amp; makes it difficult for me to want to look for very long, but it surely emphasises the new vs. the old!</td>', 'Great idea! The highlights on the new screws are a little glaring & makes it difficult for me to want to look for very long, but it surely emphasises the new vs. the old!', '2005-01-27 22:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136161, 138983, 25218, '<td valign="top">I really like the serenity you captured by the excellent use of negative space &amp; a pallete of greys. I think you rely too much on the title to relate it to the challenge, but that doesn''t make this any less of a great photo. 8</td>', 'I really like the serenity you captured by the excellent use of negative space & a pallete of greys. I think you rely too much on the title to relate it to the challenge, but that doesn''t make this any less of a great photo. 8', '2005-01-27 22:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136162, 138497, 32079, '<td valign="top">the lighting looks unever, there is excessive glare on the lower face of the rolex, and the right side is cropped too tight!!!!  haha...jk..good job on ur photo.</td>', 'the lighting looks unever, there is excessive glare on the lower face of the rolex, and the right side is cropped too tight!!!!  haha...jk..good job on ur photo.', '2005-01-27 22:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136164, 138491, 22537, '<td valign="top">This picture completely lacks creativity.  It is simply a literal presentation needed to fulfil the challenge requirements and that is all.  Both cameras are displayed equally whereas the older model is far more interesting and should have been more of a focal point.  The damask background does not fit in at all and is very distracting and is not smoothed out.  This creates wrinkles which I noticed right away. Both camera lenses have flash flares and the Minolta body moreso. When I do not see any creativity in an image I tend to focus on the technical and that is not the purpose of a photo competition.  I would suggest that you sell the sizzle and not the steak.  In this case, the shot has no sizzle whatsoever and the steak is tough to digest.</td>', 'This picture completely lacks creativity.  It is simply a literal presentation needed to fulfil the challenge requirements and that is all.  Both cameras are displayed equally whereas the older model is far more interesting and should have been more of a focal point.  The damask background does not fit in at all and is very distracting and is not smoothed out.  This creates wrinkles which I noticed right away. Both camera lenses have flash flares and the Minolta body moreso. When I do not see any creativity in an image I tend to focus on the technical and that is not the purpose of a photo competition.  I would suggest that you sell the sizzle and not the steak.  In this case, the shot has no sizzle whatsoever and the steak is tough to digest.', '2005-01-27 22:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136165, 139561, 30625, '<td valign="top">Challenge: 5 - I just dont see the old and new <br/>Composition: 5 The blue on the left just isnt necessary<br/>Technical: 5 Could have used better focusing<br/>Appeal: 4 I''m just not getting wowed.<br/>Overall: 5<br/></td>', 'Challenge: 5 - I just dont see the old and new Composition: 5 The blue on the left just isnt necessaryTechnical: 5 Could have used better focusingAppeal: 4 I''m just not getting wowed.Overall: 5', '2005-01-27 22:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136166, 140007, 30625, '<td valign="top">Challenge: 6 I think if you had concentrated more on just 2 of these.<br/>Composition: 5 I would have liked if they were all the same band, artist.<br/>Technical: 6 Nice sharp image.<br/>Appeal: 5 Its not giving me the wow factor<br/>Overall: 5<br/></td>', 'Challenge: 6 I think if you had concentrated more on just 2 of these.Composition: 5 I would have liked if they were all the same band, artist.Technical: 6 Nice sharp image.Appeal: 5 Its not giving me the wow factorOverall: 5', '2005-01-27 23:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136167, 140007, 32602, '<td valign="top">Composition is a bit boring.</td>', 'Composition is a bit boring.', '2005-01-27 23:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136170, 139981, 30625, '<td valign="top">Challenge: 6 I like the idea of the old tree and the seed for a new one.<br/>Composition: 7 I like how the picture takes me to the seeds then to its counter part  old tree trunk.<br/>Technical: 7 nice sharp picture I can see the grains in the tree.<br/>Appeal: 6 I getting moved by the picture slowly.<br/>Overall: 6<br/></td>', 'Challenge: 6 I like the idea of the old tree and the seed for a new one.Composition: 7 I like how the picture takes me to the seeds then to its counter part  old tree trunk.Technical: 7 nice sharp picture I can see the grains in the tree.Appeal: 6 I getting moved by the picture slowly.Overall: 6', '2005-01-27 23:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136173, 139776, 30625, '<td valign="top">Challenge: 6 I like the idea.<br/>Composition: 5 I think going closer would have been nice<br/>Technical: 5 I would have rather seen more of the stones and less of the background trees.<br/>Appeal: 5 Just didnt do anything for me.<br/>Overall: 5<br/></td>', 'Challenge: 6 I like the idea.Composition: 5 I think going closer would have been niceTechnical: 5 I would have rather seen more of the stones and less of the background trees.Appeal: 5 Just didnt do anything for me.Overall: 5', '2005-01-27 23:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136175, 139555, 30625, '<td valign="top">Challenge: 6 old time and new time.<br/>Composition: 6 I think the out of focus clock threw me off.<br/>Technical: 6 the focus on the watch is good but I think I would have liked it more if they were both in focus.<br/>Appeal: 6 just didnt wow me<br/>Overall: 6<br/></td>', 'Challenge: 6 old time and new time.Composition: 6 I think the out of focus clock threw me off.Technical: 6 the focus on the watch is good but I think I would have liked it more if they were both in focus.Appeal: 6 just didnt wow meOverall: 6', '2005-01-27 23:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136187, 139292, 18799, '<td valign="top">Excellent!  The idea and execution are just great!  My conflict is how to view this - it it really a photo or more of a "scan" using a camera.  In the end, I don''t care because this is so original.   10</td>', 'Excellent!  The idea and execution are just great!  My conflict is how to view this - it it really a photo or more of a "scan" using a camera.  In the end, I don''t care because this is so original.   10', '2005-01-27 23:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136197, 138505, 12253, '<td valign="top">Well composed, well done!</td>', 'Well composed, well done!', '2005-01-27 23:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136199, 139622, 18799, '<td valign="top">I think the photos should work without the title, and I don''t think this one stands on it''s own.  Not that it''s a bad photo, the diagonal is a good element.  The ice is perhaps a bit over-exposed.  5</td>', 'I think the photos should work without the title, and I don''t think this one stands on it''s own.  Not that it''s a bad photo, the diagonal is a good element.  The ice is perhaps a bit over-exposed.  5', '2005-01-27 23:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136200, 139738, 18799, '<td valign="top">There is a magenta cast to this photo, particularly evident on the tree trunk.</td>', 'There is a magenta cast to this photo, particularly evident on the tree trunk.', '2005-01-27 23:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136203, 139990, 18799, '<td valign="top">I''m not getting the old to new connection?  There must be one or you wouldn''t have submitted it, right?</td>', 'I''m not getting the old to new connection?  There must be one or you wouldn''t have submitted it, right?', '2005-01-27 23:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136211, 139989, 18799, '<td valign="top">I like your concept of the old and new.  The color and focus is spot on.  Personally, I don''t care a lot for your choice of compostion, I don''t think this should have been off-center - I tried moving it on my screen and found the image in portrait with the negative space to the left removed, to be much more pleasing.  Also,  I think there should have been some more room at the bottom as the lowest grape looks crowded.   Still, a good try - 7</td>', 'I like your concept of the old and new.  The color and focus is spot on.  Personally, I don''t care a lot for your choice of compostion, I don''t think this should have been off-center - I tried moving it on my screen and found the image in portrait with the negative space to the left removed, to be much more pleasing.  Also,  I think there should have been some more room at the bottom as the lowest grape looks crowded.   Still, a good try - 7', '2005-01-27 23:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136214, 138846, 18799, '<td valign="top">Good take on the challenge.  What great colors this old truck takes on in it''s decompostion.  7</td>', 'Good take on the challenge.  What great colors this old truck takes on in it''s decompostion.  7', '2005-01-27 23:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136217, 138983, 18799, '<td valign="top">While I like the perspective view of this image,  as a viewer I can''t tell that the structure at the end of the pier is new.</td>', 'While I like the perspective view of this image,  as a viewer I can''t tell that the structure at the end of the pier is new.', '2005-01-27 23:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136224, 139086, 30787, '<td valign="top">I don''t see old and new.</td>', 'I don''t see old and new.', '2005-01-28 00:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136226, 139518, 18799, '<td valign="top">I see one that is more ripe than the others.  It''s a stretch for me to call it old -vs- new though.  For the challenge, not so good.  As an image, well done, good use of light.</td>', 'I see one that is more ripe than the others.  It''s a stretch for me to call it old -vs- new though.  For the challenge, not so good.  As an image, well done, good use of light.', '2005-01-28 00:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136236, 139768, 18799, '<td valign="top">I like your idea.  The shadows are real killers here, as are the reflections. .  If you can''t light the background, then you should move the subjects farther away from the background to minimize the shadows.  I think the plastic cup detracts from the image - I get it without the cup.</td>', 'I like your idea.  The shadows are real killers here, as are the reflections. .  If you can''t light the background, then you should move the subjects farther away from the background to minimize the shadows.  I think the plastic cup detracts from the image - I get it without the cup.', '2005-01-28 00:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136239, 139921, 18799, '<td valign="top">Great angle to tell the story of old and new.  7</td>', 'Great angle to tell the story of old and new.  7', '2005-01-28 00:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136247, 138020, 18799, '<td valign="top">While this does tell the story of old and new, I think you could have been more creative in your approach and compositon.   The compositon is very flat and uninteresting, no offense intended.</td>', 'While this does tell the story of old and new, I think you could have been more creative in your approach and compositon.   The compositon is very flat and uninteresting, no offense intended.', '2005-01-28 00:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136251, 139895, 22537, '<td valign="top">Though this photo does meet the challenge description, it lacks any creative impact.  I see fingerprints on the wine bottle.  Flash glare on the white wine bottle and upholstery behind the presentations. The jugs would have been a better focal point since they are alot more interesting.  The title is well thought out and is soooo much stronger than this image can ever hope to be. This shot looks like it was slapped together at the last minute in order to get into the challenge.  You have an ability to weave title with challenge  but the photo falls short of your cleverness. By the way, the lamb entry is damn funny and quirky.</td>', 'Though this photo does meet the challenge description, it lacks any creative impact.  I see fingerprints on the wine bottle.  Flash glare on the white wine bottle and upholstery behind the presentations. The jugs would have been a better focal point since they are alot more interesting.  The title is well thought out and is soooo much stronger than this image can ever hope to be. This shot looks like it was slapped together at the last minute in order to get into the challenge.  You have an ability to weave title with challenge  but the photo falls short of your cleverness. By the way, the lamb entry is damn funny and quirky.', '2005-01-28 00:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136253, 139515, 18799, '<td valign="top">Wow, quite a powerful image with those strong verticals towering over the older structures.  Good job   8</td>', 'Wow, quite a powerful image with those strong verticals towering over the older structures.  Good job   8', '2005-01-28 00:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136255, 139748, 18799, '<td valign="top">The image is too small to properly judge.  From what I do see, the crop looks awkward and the distorted perspective is distracting.</td>', 'The image is too small to properly judge.  From what I do see, the crop looks awkward and the distorted perspective is distracting.', '2005-01-28 00:13:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1136262, 139689, 18799, '<td valign="top">I don''t see old and new here, sorry.  What I see is differnt light sources.  What you''ve got is good, I like the wisps of smoke on the right side.  I just don''t think this is particularly strong to the challenge.   5</td>', 'I don''t see old and new here, sorry.  What I see is differnt light sources.  What you''ve got is good, I like the wisps of smoke on the right side.  I just don''t think this is particularly strong to the challenge.   5', '2005-01-28 00:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136270, 139966, 18799, '<td valign="top">The juxtaposition is great!  I think it would have been much better on a different surface than the hand.  The skin color and textures are very distracting.</td>', 'The juxtaposition is great!  I think it would have been much better on a different surface than the hand.  The skin color and textures are very distracting.', '2005-01-28 00:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136283, 138706, 18799, '<td valign="top">Honestly, the first thing I noticed when the picture opened was the bright border.  I guess that means it''s a distraction from an otherwise nice image.</td>', 'Honestly, the first thing I noticed when the picture opened was the bright border.  I guess that means it''s a distraction from an otherwise nice image.', '2005-01-28 00:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136347, 139975, 22537, '<td valign="top">Firstly, the title is really unappealing.  Especially in this day and age, this sort of humor is just not funny because it really does happen. Onto the photo. Old and new.  Which is which?  The Fischer Price toys are not that old and is that GI Joe? Is GI Joe asking the title question?? The DOF is way off and the picture simply looks like a bunch of toys thrown together at the last minute prior to the challenge.  The composition of the shot is not that bad but overall, this shot is very weak and will be judged harshly.</td>', 'Firstly, the title is really unappealing.  Especially in this day and age, this sort of humor is just not funny because it really does happen. Onto the photo. Old and new.  Which is which?  The Fischer Price toys are not that old and is that GI Joe? Is GI Joe asking the title question?? The DOF is way off and the picture simply looks like a bunch of toys thrown together at the last minute prior to the challenge.  The composition of the shot is not that bad but overall, this shot is very weak and will be judged harshly.', '2005-01-28 00:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136388, 139813, 30490, '<td valign="top">Great idea, but the image seems to have a lot of noise in it and isn''t as crisp as I would have expected of items shot up close.</td>', 'Great idea, but the image seems to have a lot of noise in it and isn''t as crisp as I would have expected of items shot up close.', '2005-01-28 01:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136389, 139078, 30490, '<td valign="top">Very funny and creative!</td>', 'Very funny and creative!', '2005-01-28 01:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136390, 139561, 30490, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, but could have made your point if there was an old 78rpm on the turntable.</td>', 'Interesting idea, but could have made your point if there was an old 78rpm on the turntable.', '2005-01-28 01:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136391, 139795, 30490, '<td valign="top">A good idea poorly executed.  I don''t like the hot spots and the focus is off.</td>', 'A good idea poorly executed.  I don''t like the hot spots and the focus is off.', '2005-01-28 01:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136392, 139639, 30490, '<td valign="top">Nice creative idea.  The color seems a little washed out though</td>', 'Nice creative idea.  The color seems a little washed out though', '2005-01-28 01:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136393, 139776, 30490, '<td valign="top">image is too small, but you did a good job of capturing old and new</td>', 'image is too small, but you did a good job of capturing old and new', '2005-01-28 01:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136395, 139565, 30490, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but the angle of the photo is wrong, and distorts the "old" phone.</td>', 'Good idea, but the angle of the photo is wrong, and distorts the "old" phone.', '2005-01-28 01:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136397, 139654, 30490, '<td valign="top">cool idea, but the hot spots should be removed and the background color is not enhancing the image</td>', 'cool idea, but the hot spots should be removed and the background color is not enhancing the image', '2005-01-28 01:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136401, 139739, 30490, '<td valign="top">Great idea and nice execution</td>', 'Great idea and nice execution', '2005-01-28 01:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136403, 139676, 30490, '<td valign="top">Image is too small to determine if it meets the challenge criteria</td>', 'Image is too small to determine if it meets the challenge criteria', '2005-01-28 01:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136405, 139617, 30490, '<td valign="top">I''m not certain how these two items are related... I also don''t like the yellow cast to the image.</td>', 'I''m not certain how these two items are related... I also don''t like the yellow cast to the image.', '2005-01-28 01:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136412, 138841, 30490, '<td valign="top">Oh,  a good idea gone wrong....  If you had only isolated the dogs against a background and had the dogs in focus, this could have been a better photo.</td>', 'Oh,  a good idea gone wrong....  If you had only isolated the dogs against a background and had the dogs in focus, this could have been a better photo.', '2005-01-28 01:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136413, 139555, 30490, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but next time wipe the fingerprint off of the watch</td>', 'Good idea, but next time wipe the fingerprint off of the watch', '2005-01-28 01:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136487, 139998, 32602, '<td valign="top">This compostion  of  this musical "old and new"  stands out , it''s a shame it is blurry.</td>', 'This compostion  of  this musical "old and new"  stands out , it''s a shame it is blurry.', '2005-01-28 03:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136511, 139980, 26679, '<td valign="top">You gave applied th rule of thirds and placed these rings on the top third.<br/>However for me there is too much space in this image. <br/>I would have preferd a tighter crop, with the centre of each ring being on the thirds line left to right<br/>and the bottom ring being on the bottom thirds line bottom to top. <br/></td>', 'You gave applied th rule of thirds and placed these rings on the top third.However for me there is too much space in this image. I would have preferd a tighter crop, with the centre of each ring being on the thirds line left to rightand the bottom ring being on the bottom thirds line bottom to top. ', '2005-01-28 05:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136512, 138824, 26679, '<td valign="top">I wish the bad penny was a little sharper focussed.</td>', 'I wish the bad penny was a little sharper focussed.', '2005-01-28 05:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136514, 139748, 26679, '<td valign="top">I like the jusxtaposition, If the image were a little larger, I feel  you would be able to see more detail in the brickwork.<br/>Which would provide the added bonus of texture in this image</td>', 'I like the jusxtaposition, If the image were a little larger, I feel  you would be able to see more detail in the brickwork.Which would provide the added bonus of texture in this image', '2005-01-28 05:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136517, 139069, 26679, '<td valign="top">I love the idea and feel this would have had greater impact if the date on the new coins were all the same, and all of a date 2000 Plus this would then show a greater differential between old and New.</td>', 'I love the idea and feel this would have had greater impact if the date on the new coins were all the same, and all of a date 2000 Plus this would then show a greater differential between old and New.', '2005-01-28 05:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136519, 139853, 26679, '<td valign="top">I still find that my 78''s have a wonderfull tone to them.<br/>The cylinders are not as good though....<br/></td>', 'I still find that my 78''s have a wonderfull tone to them.The cylinders are not as good though....', '2005-01-28 05:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136520, 139990, 26679, '<td valign="top">To take this one step further, placing the Martini glas on a bed of sand, would certainly meet the challenge</td>', 'To take this one step further, placing the Martini glas on a bed of sand, would certainly meet the challenge', '2005-01-28 05:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136524, 138491, 26679, '<td valign="top">The B/W help with the juxtaposition, I would prefer a more neutral back cloth as this is rather busy</td>', 'The B/W help with the juxtaposition, I would prefer a more neutral back cloth as this is rather busy', '2005-01-28 05:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136527, 139340, 26679, '<td valign="top">I like the idea two Verniers one digital one not.<br/> <br/>I wish there was not quote so much shadow here, some lighting on the paper would really lift this image.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I like the idea two Verniers one digital one not. I wish there was not quote so much shadow here, some lighting on the paper would really lift this image. ', '2005-01-28 05:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136529, 139546, 26679, '<td valign="top">The Gerkin looks good from this angle and the sky adds drama to the image.</td>', 'The Gerkin looks good from this angle and the sky adds drama to the image.', '2005-01-28 05:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136531, 139888, 26679, '<td valign="top">The socks make this a very interesting composition. Although I think thre is still a few more miles left in the old sneekers</td>', 'The socks make this a very interesting composition. Although I think thre is still a few more miles left in the old sneekers', '2005-01-28 05:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136534, 140006, 26679, '<td valign="top">I love the shape of this tree, It shows exactly what pollarding can do.</td>', 'I love the shape of this tree, It shows exactly what pollarding can do.', '2005-01-28 05:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136537, 138505, 26679, '<td valign="top">What goes around come around.</td>', 'What goes around come around.', '2005-01-28 05:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136539, 138031, 26679, '<td valign="top">Very good Idea, I would love to have seen a deeper DOF here though.</td>', 'Very good Idea, I would love to have seen a deeper DOF here though.', '2005-01-28 05:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136574, 139546, 749, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of one I took a few weeks ago, which I''ll link you once voting is over - so I know that you''ve flipped L&amp;R on this shot :o) You''ve managed to keep the highlights from blowing out, but boosted it enough to make the tower stand out against the skyline, nicely done. Oh, and it appears we''re the only two Gerkin entries, which surprised me!<br/> <br/>EDIT: oh wait, you took a shot from the north or east side of the Tower, not the south (ie riverside), so you haven''t flipped the image, doh! :o)</td>', 'Reminds me of one I took a few weeks ago, which I''ll link you once voting is over - so I know that you''ve flipped L&R on this shot :o) You''ve managed to keep the highlights from blowing out, but boosted it enough to make the tower stand out against the skyline, nicely done. Oh, and it appears we''re the only two Gerkin entries, which surprised me! EDIT: oh wait, you took a shot from the north or east side of the Tower, not the south (ie riverside), so you haven''t flipped the image, doh! :o)', '2005-01-28 06:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136580, 138819, 25355, '<td valign="top">Background is way too distracting; you could have done much better with this subject (inclding filling the bottles, perhaps).</td>', 'Background is way too distracting; you could have done much better with this subject (inclding filling the bottles, perhaps).', '2005-01-28 06:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136582, 139930, 25355, '<td valign="top">The focus is off and the point of view could have been better selected.</td>', 'The focus is off and the point of view could have been better selected.', '2005-01-28 06:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136603, 139975, 25355, '<td valign="top">Not sure that this fits the theme... nope, don''t get it at all.</td>', 'Not sure that this fits the theme... nope, don''t get it at all.', '2005-01-28 07:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136627, 139623, 31443, '<td valign="top">Nice idea but I wish the images were a tad clearer overall</td>', 'Nice idea but I wish the images were a tad clearer overall', '2005-01-28 07:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136636, 138740, 15305, '<td valign="top">Marvelous concept. Great work!!  I like the mood and lighting.</td>', 'Marvelous concept. Great work!!  I like the mood and lighting.', '2005-01-28 08:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136703, 138473, 3569, '<td valign="top">great subject, but the wood background is somewhat distracting the fine old lure</td>', 'great subject, but the wood background is somewhat distracting the fine old lure', '2005-01-28 09:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136709, 139755, 3569, '<td valign="top">meets the challenge quite well.  Nice shot</td>', 'meets the challenge quite well.  Nice shot', '2005-01-28 09:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136716, 139923, 32633, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice shot!  The title is perfect it tells the viewer exactly what the shot is about.. I really like the way the photo is slightly distorted it gives the image a new look and feel. I love how the new buildings oversee and in a way overpower the old! It gives a person that whole overcrowded sense of feeling. I also like the way it looks like the sun is getting ready to shine through but can''t because of the tall buildings. Nice job this shot was taken well and you can tell you put thought into it.. it wasn''t just a snapshot!</td>', 'This is a very nice shot!  The title is perfect it tells the viewer exactly what the shot is about.. I really like the way the photo is slightly distorted it gives the image a new look and feel. I love how the new buildings oversee and in a way overpower the old! It gives a person that whole overcrowded sense of feeling. I also like the way it looks like the sun is getting ready to shine through but can''t because of the tall buildings. Nice job this shot was taken well and you can tell you put thought into it.. it wasn''t just a snapshot!', '2005-01-28 09:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136718, 138925, 26679, '<td valign="top">Being pedantic, the wind mill generates power, the wires tranmit the power, however the imagery does work.</td>', 'Being pedantic, the wind mill generates power, the wires tranmit the power, however the imagery does work.', '2005-01-28 09:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136721, 139749, 32633, '<td valign="top">I really really like this photograph.. I love to look at photos of mystery! This image looks mysterious and I really like how the dark blacks and grays portray that. I like the detail in the trees and building and how you can see objects all the way in the back of the background.  I also like how the sky is really dark at the top but it gets slightly darker at the bottom, this helps with the erie feel the image gives off. This is really a interesting shot. Nice work!!</td>', 'I really really like this photograph.. I love to look at photos of mystery! This image looks mysterious and I really like how the dark blacks and grays portray that. I like the detail in the trees and building and how you can see objects all the way in the back of the background.  I also like how the sky is really dark at the top but it gets slightly darker at the bottom, this helps with the erie feel the image gives off. This is really a interesting shot. Nice work!!', '2005-01-28 09:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136726, 139885, 32633, '<td valign="top">This is a nice photograph. I really like the way you interpreted your subject. There is a message behind the image and your title shows that perfectly. Your detail is wonderful you can see all of the old womans wrinkles and strands of hair easily; as well as,  the young girls highlights and everything. This is a very crisp photo. Nice work I love it.</td>', 'This is a nice photograph. I really like the way you interpreted your subject. There is a message behind the image and your title shows that perfectly. Your detail is wonderful you can see all of the old womans wrinkles and strands of hair easily; as well as,  the young girls highlights and everything. This is a very crisp photo. Nice work I love it.', '2005-01-28 09:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136729, 139230, 32633, '<td valign="top">This is a nice photo. I like the way the light shines behind the trees onto the road, it gives the image more personality. I also like the way we are forced to look through the icicles like a screen in order to see the background beyond them. This is a very pretty shot. Nice work.</td>', 'This is a nice photo. I like the way the light shines behind the trees onto the road, it gives the image more personality. I also like the way we are forced to look through the icicles like a screen in order to see the background beyond them. This is a very pretty shot. Nice work.', '2005-01-28 09:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136732, 139342, 26679, '<td valign="top">As a photograph this has good balance an compositio.<br/>however it is not obvious how this is meeting this particular challenge <br/>If I guess  one shoe is old and the other is new, but unfortunatly this does not show here...</td>', 'As a photograph this has good balance an compositio.however it is not obvious how this is meeting this particular challenge If I guess  one shoe is old and the other is new, but unfortunatly this does not show here...', '2005-01-28 09:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136737, 139901, 32633, '<td valign="top">This is a good shot. I like the way the light shines through the back. I also like the fact that the growth is on the tombstone itself, it makes the shot look more beautiful and natural. I like nature so this shot appealed to me. I also like the fact that you didn''t focus on just one straight gravestone, you quite a few other gravestones in the shot and the stone in the center toward the back it sort of slanted.. I really like that it helps show that this really is an old world like your title stated. You can tell time and effort went into this shot. I really liked this image and I think you did a nice job!</td>', 'This is a good shot. I like the way the light shines through the back. I also like the fact that the growth is on the tombstone itself, it makes the shot look more beautiful and natural. I like nature so this shot appealed to me. I also like the fact that you didn''t focus on just one straight gravestone, you quite a few other gravestones in the shot and the stone in the center toward the back it sort of slanted.. I really like that it helps show that this really is an old world like your title stated. You can tell time and effort went into this shot. I really liked this image and I think you did a nice job!', '2005-01-28 09:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136753, 138309, 32633, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. I love the title it tells exactly what the shot is about. I love the colors in this photo, they are very bright and vibrant. I like how it is a single leaf to focus on and then the background shines through and just helps to focus on the leaf. I also like how the leaf is in focus but the background is not it helps for the viewer to tell what your main focus is.. this is a very nice shot. Nice job.</td>', 'I really like this shot. I love the title it tells exactly what the shot is about. I love the colors in this photo, they are very bright and vibrant. I like how it is a single leaf to focus on and then the background shines through and just helps to focus on the leaf. I also like how the leaf is in focus but the background is not it helps for the viewer to tell what your main focus is.. this is a very nice shot. Nice job.', '2005-01-28 09:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136760, 138603, 32633, '<td valign="top">This was probably one of my favorite photographs just because it is such a beautiful shot. I like the way you interpreted your topic! New snow on an old mountain is a great title for this image. I love the way it looks like the clouds are starting to come in and cover the mountain.. it almost gives it a mysterious yet natural feel. I also like the way the trees we are looking through almost look like a border to a beautiful painting. I love the way the image is dark at the bottom but as the person rises to the top of the image near the mountain and snow the picture lights up and becomes bright. I think this is a very beautiful picture and I can tell a lot of work went into it. I love nature and breathless shots like these so this image really appealed to me. Nice work I loved it.</td>', 'This was probably one of my favorite photographs just because it is such a beautiful shot. I like the way you interpreted your topic! New snow on an old mountain is a great title for this image. I love the way it looks like the clouds are starting to come in and cover the mountain.. it almost gives it a mysterious yet natural feel. I also like the way the trees we are looking through almost look like a border to a beautiful painting. I love the way the image is dark at the bottom but as the person rises to the top of the image near the mountain and snow the picture lights up and becomes bright. I think this is a very beautiful picture and I can tell a lot of work went into it. I love nature and breathless shots like these so this image really appealed to me. Nice work I loved it.', '2005-01-28 09:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136761, 139969, 26679, '<td valign="top">The shadow of the film casting over CF is a great idea.<br/>Unfortunatly, this composition is a liitle bit let down by the other shodows being cast and the "thing" in the top left hand corner</td>', 'The shadow of the film casting over CF is a great idea.Unfortunatly, this composition is a liitle bit let down by the other shodows being cast and the "thing" in the top left hand corner', '2005-01-28 09:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
