(1137421, 139817, 27845, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of my outtake. Nice shot, great lighting (dawn?) in the upper half, a bit too flat in the lower half. Nice colours and tones. 7.</td>', 'Reminds me of my outtake. Nice shot, great lighting (dawn?) in the upper half, a bit too flat in the lower half. Nice colours and tones. 7.', '2005-01-28 16:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1137427, 139871, 27845, '<td valign="top">So, which one''s new and which one''s old? I know you''re referring to the three men as old, but the difference isn''t clear enough. Also, you cropped off the dog''s right foot. Your lighting is good thouh. The shadows are just right. 4.</td>', 'So, which one''s new and which one''s old? I know you''re referring to the three men as old, but the difference isn''t clear enough. Also, you cropped off the dog''s right foot. Your lighting is good thouh. The shadows are just right. 4.', '2005-01-28 16:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1137432, 139767, 27845, '<td valign="top">Intersting idea, but the background should be red all the way down. There''s some kind of scratch between the cams in the background. Or I''m just seeing things (time to go to bed ;)<br/>Perhaps a less direct perspective would have been nice. Like, taking a shot over the shoulder of someone photographing the old camera...if you understand what I mean, it''s hard to explain what I have in mind. 5.</td>', 'Intersting idea, but the background should be red all the way down. There''s some kind of scratch between the cams in the background. Or I''m just seeing things (time to go to bed ;)Perhaps a less direct perspective would have been nice. Like, taking a shot over the shoulder of someone photographing the old camera...if you understand what I mean, it''s hard to explain what I have in mind. 5.', '2005-01-28 16:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1137434, 139078, 27845, '<td valign="top">Lol! Nice title. Good idea. Sorry for your car. 5.</td>', 'Lol! Nice title. Good idea. Sorry for your car. 5.', '2005-01-28 16:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1137437, 138031, 27845, '<td valign="top">Wohoooo! So funny. If the film was in focus just a little more it''d be perfect. Very creative. 10.</td>', 'Wohoooo! So funny. If the film was in focus just a little more it''d be perfect. Very creative. 10.', '2005-01-28 16:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1137438, 139885, 27845, '<td valign="top">Intersting perspective. Looks cool, I especially like the noise. The only distracting thing is the text in the background. 8.</td>', 'Intersting perspective. Looks cool, I especially like the noise. The only distracting thing is the text in the background. 8.', '2005-01-28 16:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1137443, 139924, 27845, '<td valign="top">Over-exposed. Bad JPEG artifacts. And they both look quite young. Did you want to tell the mother she''s old? Watch out! 3.</td>', 'Over-exposed. Bad JPEG artifacts. And they both look quite young. Did you want to tell the mother she''s old? Watch out! 3.', '2005-01-28 16:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1137446, 139093, 27845, '<td valign="top">Too rigid. How about a big pile of books? That would bring in more dynamic. You have too many vertical lines. Also, chose another light source next time to avoid the gkares on the books'' backs. 4.</td>', 'Too rigid. How about a big pile of books? That would bring in more dynamic. You have too many vertical lines. Also, chose another light source next time to avoid the gkares on the books'' backs. 4.', '2005-01-28 16:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1137449, 139930, 27845, '<td valign="top">Out of focus. Too small. Why did you take the picture from right above. You should have lowered your cam to the flower''s level. 3.</td>', 'Out of focus. Too small. Why did you take the picture from right above. You should have lowered your cam to the flower''s level. 3.', '2005-01-28 16:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1137453, 138716, 27845, '<td valign="top">I guess your title is to suggest that your picture meets the challenge even though it''s not obvious. Well, the only thing I can imagine for this shot to fit the challenge is that in the center of the plant new leaves start to grow. Is that what you''re referring to? Nice bokeh. A bit grainy, some NeatImage would have been good. 5.</td>', 'I guess your title is to suggest that your picture meets the challenge even though it''s not obvious. Well, the only thing I can imagine for this shot to fit the challenge is that in the center of the plant new leaves start to grow. Is that what you''re referring to? Nice bokeh. A bit grainy, some NeatImage would have been good. 5.', '2005-01-28 16:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1137456, 138214, 27845, '<td valign="top">Your CD is out of focus. Use a smaller aperture (or was it bigger?... check the tutorials if you want to be sure, I''m not anymore ;) to get a wider DOF. Flipping the image would have been good, to make the iPod display readable. 4.</td>', 'Your CD is out of focus. Use a smaller aperture (or was it bigger?... check the tutorials if you want to be sure, I''m not anymore ;) to get a wider DOF. Flipping the image would have been good, to make the iPod display readable. 4.', '2005-01-28 16:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1137458, 138829, 27845, '<td valign="top">Cool. Very strong old/new, smooth/rough, bright/dark, round/edgy contrast. I don''t like the composition though. You cut off the tower''s top and I don''t like it''s position in the image. It is too cenetred for me. Cropping off some of the right side might be good. 7.</td>', 'Cool. Very strong old/new, smooth/rough, bright/dark, round/edgy contrast. I don''t like the composition though. You cut off the tower''s top and I don''t like it''s position in the image. It is too cenetred for me. Cropping off some of the right side might be good. 7.', '2005-01-28 16:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1137464, 139792, 27845, '<td valign="top">Good composition. I like the tilt. Good DOF. The grain is interesting and adds to the image''s character. 10.</td>', 'Good composition. I like the tilt. Good DOF. The grain is interesting and adds to the image''s character. 10.', '2005-01-28 16:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1137465, 139977, 27845, '<td valign="top">You might have desaturated or saturated the green channel. Now it''s somthing in between which doesn''t look too well. 5.</td>', 'You might have desaturated or saturated the green channel. Now it''s somthing in between which doesn''t look too well. 5.', '2005-01-28 16:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1137469, 138284, 27845, '<td valign="top">Good picture. Only the bike is somewhat distracting. I like the persons, they give the shot a sense of dimensions. Fits the challenge well. 9.</td>', 'Good picture. Only the bike is somewhat distracting. I like the persons, they give the shot a sense of dimensions. Fits the challenge well. 9.', '2005-01-28 16:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1137473, 138793, 27845, '<td valign="top">Nice interpretation of the challenge. I didn''t think of that. You stand out of the crowd. I like the emotions in here. The have fun! I don''t like the fallen leaves though, for me they are too much a symbol of death and decline...maybe I just read too much poetry ;) 8.</td>', 'Nice interpretation of the challenge. I didn''t think of that. You stand out of the crowd. I like the emotions in here. The have fun! I don''t like the fallen leaves though, for me they are too much a symbol of death and decline...maybe I just read too much poetry ;) 8.', '2005-01-28 17:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1137477, 139969, 27845, '<td valign="top">Nice shadow work. The composition is not that harmonic though...evrything is in that one diagonal line. And the shadow in the upper left corner belongs to no object inside the frame and is thus distracting. 6.</td>', 'Nice shadow work. The composition is not that harmonic though...evrything is in that one diagonal line. And the shadow in the upper left corner belongs to no object inside the frame and is thus distracting. 6.', '2005-01-28 17:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1137481, 139086, 27845, '<td valign="top">A nice go. The best juxtaposition of medias if seen so far. Nice duotone. Detailed, sharp, neat. 8.</td>', 'A nice go. The best juxtaposition of medias if seen so far. Nice duotone. Detailed, sharp, neat. 8.', '2005-01-28 17:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1137484, 139766, 27845, '<td valign="top">Did you actually spin your iPod on the other apparatus (I don''t know the English name for it). Crazy. I think b&amp;w would have been better for this shot, as there is not much colour left anyways. 5.</td>', 'Did you actually spin your iPod on the other apparatus (I don''t know the English name for it). Crazy. I think b&w would have been better for this shot, as there is not much colour left anyways. 5.', '2005-01-28 17:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1137491, 139307, 27845, '<td valign="top">So nature''s old and men are new. Yes, I like that interpretation. I don''t know how to link the birds to it, but for the rest, your picture is very interesting. The boat in the background is a nice detail. I don''t like the centered horizon though. Cropping off some of the bottom and off the top would have given you a perfect rule of thirds. 9.</td>', 'So nature''s old and men are new. Yes, I like that interpretation. I don''t know how to link the birds to it, but for the rest, your picture is very interesting. The boat in the background is a nice detail. I don''t like the centered horizon though. Cropping off some of the bottom and off the top would have given you a perfect rule of thirds. 9.', '2005-01-28 17:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1137542, 139211, 32792, '<td valign="top">Picture and title describes it all!<br/>Very nice shot!</td>', 'Picture and title describes it all!Very nice shot!', '2005-01-28 17:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
