(1138041, 138729, 29513, '<td valign="top">The problem I see here is depth of field.  Both of the vehicles are the "subject" here and so both need to be sharp.  I realize that that is sometimes easier said than done.  I like the detail on the steam locomotive and the work table between them.</td>', 'The problem I see here is depth of field.  Both of the vehicles are the "subject" here and so both need to be sharp.  I realize that that is sometimes easier said than done.  I like the detail on the steam locomotive and the work table between them.', '2005-01-28 22:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
