(1139033, 139862, 18349, '<td valign="top">The lamp is great... but the style of the lamp and the curtain don''t mesh well with the table. The silver, curves, and blue go well together but that woodgrain tabletop doesn''t seem to fit well. Two totally different styles, which might be off-putting to the voters. It would be something to hang on a wall without the table or with a more modern looking table.  Just my opinion.</td>', 'The lamp is great... but the style of the lamp and the curtain don''t mesh well with the table. The silver, curves, and blue go well together but that woodgrain tabletop doesn''t seem to fit well. Two totally different styles, which might be off-putting to the voters. It would be something to hang on a wall without the table or with a more modern looking table.  Just my opinion.', '2005-01-29 17:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139038, 138958, 22011, '<td valign="top">This is just tooo sweet..  It''s my favourite from the bunch this time around, but I feer the cat haters will vote you down..  Maybe could have had a little more light o the scales, but a great photo for the wall none the less..</td>', 'This is just tooo sweet..  It''s my favourite from the bunch this time around, but I feer the cat haters will vote you down..  Maybe could have had a little more light o the scales, but a great photo for the wall none the less..', '2005-01-29 17:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139041, 139888, 22011, '<td valign="top">I simply love the socks....  Not sure where the yello highlight at the toe of the new shoe is coming from, and that looks a little out of place, but otherwise a cery clean shot...  8</td>', 'I simply love the socks....  Not sure where the yello highlight at the toe of the new shoe is coming from, and that looks a little out of place, but otherwise a cery clean shot...  8', '2005-01-29 17:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139043, 139885, 22011, '<td valign="top">Classic street photography...  Set up camp near a point of interest and wait for folks to walk past?  The contrast is dramatic, and the grain/noise works well to enhance the moment.  7</td>', 'Classic street photography...  Set up camp near a point of interest and wait for folks to walk past?  The contrast is dramatic, and the grain/noise works well to enhance the moment.  7', '2005-01-29 18:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139046, 138031, 22011, '<td valign="top">My favourite of the ''film and card'' shots..  Well imagined..  If the image was a little sharper overall it would have been great.  7</td>', 'My favourite of the ''film and card'' shots..  Well imagined..  If the image was a little sharper overall it would have been great.  7', '2005-01-29 18:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
