(1139049, 139945, 22011, '<td valign="top">The title is great, but you''s sold your photo short by not using the full 640pixels allowed.  The image is too small to see what you were trying to get at. IMHO.</td>', 'The title is great, but you''s sold your photo short by not using the full 640pixels allowed.  The image is too small to see what you were trying to get at. IMHO.', '2005-01-29 18:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139050, 139655, 22011, '<td valign="top">Ummmmmm,  Old &amp; New?      Nice horse pick though...   You''ve chopped off the poor chaps nose though, and that looks a little odd to me.  Getting the whole face in the shot, and maybe moving a bit to your left to reduce the amount of ''dark'' in the shot would make this a keeper..</td>', 'Ummmmmm,  Old & New?      Nice horse pick though...   You''ve chopped off the poor chaps nose though, and that looks a little odd to me.  Getting the whole face in the shot, and maybe moving a bit to your left to reduce the amount of ''dark'' in the shot would make this a keeper..', '2005-01-29 18:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139053, 138408, 22011, '<td valign="top">This ust be one of those ''interesting photos, wrong challenge'' deals..<br/> <br/>I''ve spent a couple of minutes looking at this, trying to ''get'' it..  But it''s just not working for me.</td>', 'This ust be one of those ''interesting photos, wrong challenge'' deals.. I''ve spent a couple of minutes looking at this, trying to ''get'' it..  But it''s just not working for me.', '2005-01-29 18:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139054, 139886, 22011, '<td valign="top">That''s one big new powerstation, but where''s the old one...  never the lest, this is quite an interesting photo, the tugs in the forground are neat, and the repetition of the three works...  5</td>', 'That''s one big new powerstation, but where''s the old one...  never the lest, this is quite an interesting photo, the tugs in the forground are neat, and the repetition of the three works...  5', '2005-01-29 18:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139060, 139923, 22011, '<td valign="top">Wow...   Composing images with fisheye''s is quite often difficult, you''ve pulled it off well here, and the reflected light on the older building is neat...  8<br/> <br/>It''ll be interesting to read you comments after the challenge to see what lens/camera you used as well..</td>', 'Wow...   Composing images with fisheye''s is quite often difficult, you''ve pulled it off well here, and the reflected light on the older building is neat...  8 It''ll be interesting to read you comments after the challenge to see what lens/camera you used as well..', '2005-01-29 18:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139092, 138873, 31720, '<td valign="top">Much too overexposed, causing most of the picture to be washed out in white.</td>', 'Much too overexposed, causing most of the picture to be washed out in white.', '2005-01-29 19:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139095, 139895, 31720, '<td valign="top">Technically, wine isn''t a spirit, but this is still a good picture.</td>', 'Technically, wine isn''t a spirit, but this is still a good picture.', '2005-01-29 19:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139099, 139748, 31720, '<td valign="top">Though it could be bigger, the main problem with this picture is the amount of JPEG compression, which broke up the not-quite-vertical lines into little pieces of alternating color, not to mention obscuring the brickwork of the old building.  Reducing a picture to 1/6 of the maximum file size (25kB vs. the max of 150kB) unnecessarily sheds detail from a picture.</td>', 'Though it could be bigger, the main problem with this picture is the amount of JPEG compression, which broke up the not-quite-vertical lines into little pieces of alternating color, not to mention obscuring the brickwork of the old building.  Reducing a picture to 1/6 of the maximum file size (25kB vs. the max of 150kB) unnecessarily sheds detail from a picture.', '2005-01-29 19:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139123, 139594, 31720, '<td valign="top">Being slightly out of focus really takes away from this picture.</td>', 'Being slightly out of focus really takes away from this picture.', '2005-01-29 19:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139141, 139813, 31720, '<td valign="top">Way too much JPEG compression</td>', 'Way too much JPEG compression', '2005-01-29 19:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139145, 138381, 31720, '<td valign="top">Good picture, but this would have been better if the whole hand was visible.  It looks odd with the fingertips cut off.</td>', 'Good picture, but this would have been better if the whole hand was visible.  It looks odd with the fingertips cut off.', '2005-01-29 19:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139162, 139107, 13688, '<td valign="top">I really like this idea.  I would have liked to see more of the foreground totempole at an angle where the tree is blocked out looking towards the newer pole, without as much depth of field...perhaps too much in the way of art for this site...anyway nice concept.</td>', 'I really like this idea.  I would have liked to see more of the foreground totempole at an angle where the tree is blocked out looking towards the newer pole, without as much depth of field...perhaps too much in the way of art for this site...anyway nice concept.', '2005-01-29 19:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
