(1139192, 139860, 13688, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  I think a desat on everything except main screw and then bump the contrast to  give them a super industrial feel wold have made for a really cool pic.</td>', 'Nice idea.  I think a desat on everything except main screw and then bump the contrast to  give them a super industrial feel wold have made for a really cool pic.', '2005-01-29 19:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
