(1139246, 139992, 13688, '<td valign="top">Great concept.  Your selection of emptiness is very intriguing. I may really not no what you were going for but  IMO move the bottom row into the top and just have the ipod''s section be the only empty one and move the ipod to the left side and I think you had it.</td>', 'Great concept.  Your selection of emptiness is very intriguing. I may really not no what you were going for but  IMO move the bottom row into the top and just have the ipod''s section be the only empty one and move the ipod to the left side and I think you had it.', '2005-01-29 20:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139266, 138008, 31720, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo, but I don''t see any juxtaposition.</td>', 'Beautiful photo, but I don''t see any juxtaposition.', '2005-01-29 20:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139285, 139496, 31720, '<td valign="top">Great image that could only be made better by wiping off the CD beforehand.</td>', 'Great image that could only be made better by wiping off the CD beforehand.', '2005-01-29 20:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139347, 139211, 23583, '<td valign="top">I really like the color in this picture, and the relatively unique idea of something "old" actually being the "new" component.  The person in the picture at first distracted me, but when I look at it again she (?) seems to add something--maybe balance?</td>', 'I really like the color in this picture, and the relatively unique idea of something "old" actually being the "new" component.  The person in the picture at first distracted me, but when I look at it again she (?) seems to add something--maybe balance?', '2005-01-29 20:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139363, 138761, 32608, '<td valign="top">nice lighting, well composed<br/></td>', 'nice lighting, well composed', '2005-01-29 20:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139411, 139761, 23583, '<td valign="top">Having the mouse lit adds a nice detail. :)</td>', 'Having the mouse lit adds a nice detail. :)', '2005-01-29 20:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139434, 139496, 32608, '<td valign="top">theme well thought out.  excellent compositin and lighting</td>', 'theme well thought out.  excellent compositin and lighting', '2005-01-29 20:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139438, 139673, 23583, '<td valign="top">The palm trees make you want to think "primitive," but the guard rail brings you back to the modern age.  I''m not sure that is the contrast you were going for though--it looks like you wanted to contrast the brown palms with the green ones.  If that is the case, cropping out the guard rail might have brought more attention to the contrast you intended.   Did you take this from a moving car (which might have caused the blurry trees at the bottom)?</td>', 'The palm trees make you want to think "primitive," but the guard rail brings you back to the modern age.  I''m not sure that is the contrast you were going for though--it looks like you wanted to contrast the brown palms with the green ones.  If that is the case, cropping out the guard rail might have brought more attention to the contrast you intended.   Did you take this from a moving car (which might have caused the blurry trees at the bottom)?', '2005-01-29 20:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139440, 139930, 32608, '<td valign="top">either my glasses are dirty, or its just a tad out of focus<br/></td>', 'either my glasses are dirty, or its just a tad out of focus', '2005-01-29 20:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139447, 139616, 32608, '<td valign="top">well composed and thought out<br/></td>', 'well composed and thought out', '2005-01-29 20:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139450, 138008, 23583, '<td valign="top">The picture is a aesthetically pleasing to me.  I infer that the new/old contrast was the newish carrier with the eternity of nature (the water, the sun)?  I think the sunset confuses it a little bit, because then I start to think of the day as old, but obviously this "day" is newer than the carrier.  (The fact that this photo makes me think about what is new and what is old is a good sign though.)</td>', 'The picture is a aesthetically pleasing to me.  I infer that the new/old contrast was the newish carrier with the eternity of nature (the water, the sun)?  I think the sunset confuses it a little bit, because then I start to think of the day as old, but obviously this "day" is newer than the carrier.  (The fact that this photo makes me think about what is new and what is old is a good sign though.)', '2005-01-29 20:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139453, 139969, 32608, '<td valign="top">great depth of field, composition and lighting.</td>', 'great depth of field, composition and lighting.', '2005-01-29 20:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139457, 139882, 31720, '<td valign="top">Cool photograph, but there''s no juxtaposition with anything old.</td>', 'Cool photograph, but there''s no juxtaposition with anything old.', '2005-01-29 21:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139458, 139955, 23583, '<td valign="top">I really like this composition, and it contrasts new and old quite well.  (I especially like the cracks on the ground.)  I think the colors could be a bit richer (making the ground and leaf darker), and it would be more appealing to me if the tip of the leaf wasn''t cut off, but I like it nonetheless.</td>', 'I really like this composition, and it contrasts new and old quite well.  (I especially like the cracks on the ground.)  I think the colors could be a bit richer (making the ground and leaf darker), and it would be more appealing to me if the tip of the leaf wasn''t cut off, but I like it nonetheless.', '2005-01-29 21:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139461, 138605, 32608, '<td valign="top">best live/shriveled shot ive seen.  pleasing colors and well composed<br/></td>', 'best live/shriveled shot ive seen.  pleasing colors and well composed', '2005-01-29 21:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139466, 138873, 27812, '<td valign="top">excellent choice for this composition, reminds me of goodmans work which I really admire. 10</td>', 'excellent choice for this composition, reminds me of goodmans work which I really admire. 10', '2005-01-29 21:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139467, 139980, 23583, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of the picture.  The position of the rings in the frame seems a little off to me--I want to nudge them around a little or perhaps crop it differently.  But that''s a matter of personal taste, I suppose.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of the picture.  The position of the rings in the frame seems a little off to me--I want to nudge them around a little or perhaps crop it differently.  But that''s a matter of personal taste, I suppose.', '2005-01-29 21:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139469, 139792, 23583, '<td valign="top">The woman in the middle staring at the camera adds so much--she seems like she would pull your attention away from the main subjects, but she doesn''t (at least for me), yet her presence adds something interesting.  I also like the angle in this picture.</td>', 'The woman in the middle staring at the camera adds so much--she seems like she would pull your attention away from the main subjects, but she doesn''t (at least for me), yet her presence adds something interesting.  I also like the angle in this picture.', '2005-01-29 21:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139471, 138928, 23583, '<td valign="top">I don''t think I would have chosen to emphasize the red/brown in the photo as much as you did, but this is definitely a funny find.</td>', 'I don''t think I would have chosen to emphasize the red/brown in the photo as much as you did, but this is definitely a funny find.', '2005-01-29 21:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
