(1139828, 138490, 31443, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea...just wish you didn''t crop so much, tad too dark for me, maybe my monitor....</td>', 'Very nice idea...just wish you didn''t crop so much, tad too dark for me, maybe my monitor....', '2005-01-30 04:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139829, 138846, 31443, '<td valign="top">Clever composition, like it a lot</td>', 'Clever composition, like it a lot', '2005-01-30 04:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139830, 139467, 31443, '<td valign="top">Not a very good setup at all, the reflection of the old is on the new! The idea is good though</td>', 'Not a very good setup at all, the reflection of the old is on the new! The idea is good though', '2005-01-30 04:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139831, 140011, 31443, '<td valign="top">I was wondering where people would grow grapes at this time of year....never heard of Winter Grapes before. The idea is good but imo image is a tad too close.</td>', 'I was wondering where people would grow grapes at this time of year....never heard of Winter Grapes before. The idea is good but imo image is a tad too close.', '2005-01-30 04:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139832, 138804, 31443, '<td valign="top">Great composition, wonder how many of those paper pads you need to equal the new one? Would have been fun to see a stack though...sorry just me thinking out loud....love the photo</td>', 'Great composition, wonder how many of those paper pads you need to equal the new one? Would have been fun to see a stack though...sorry just me thinking out loud....love the photo', '2005-01-30 04:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139833, 139616, 31443, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot</td>', 'Beautiful shot', '2005-01-30 04:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139875, 138168, 10858, '<td valign="top">I like the mood of this photo, the warm brown tones with the cold grey tones. Though, the CD could be sharper, the photo needs more contrast in my opinion. Why did you upload it this small? It would be definitely more enjoyable with about 400*640 dimensions!</td>', 'I like the mood of this photo, the warm brown tones with the cold grey tones. Though, the CD could be sharper, the photo needs more contrast in my opinion. Why did you upload it this small? It would be definitely more enjoyable with about 400*640 dimensions!', '2005-01-30 07:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139876, 138411, 10858, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but I have enough of 200*300 photos! :-( Why didn''t you upload it with the largest dimensions possible (640 pixels wide)? I can hardly see a thing this way. :-( The idea is nice anyway, I like the subject chosen, photography. Composition needs a bit of improvement in my opinion, I would have put the machines a bit more together. (Rating is because of the size of your photo...)</td>', 'Sorry, but I have enough of 200*300 photos! :-( Why didn''t you upload it with the largest dimensions possible (640 pixels wide)? I can hardly see a thing this way. :-( The idea is nice anyway, I like the subject chosen, photography. Composition needs a bit of improvement in my opinion, I would have put the machines a bit more together. (Rating is because of the size of your photo...)', '2005-01-30 07:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139877, 139823, 10858, '<td valign="top">I love creativity here!  Nice composition and DOF, I would have got rid of the remain of dust and maybe it would be even more better if the front side of the CD was sharp, too. Just an idea.</td>', 'I love creativity here!  Nice composition and DOF, I would have got rid of the remain of dust and maybe it would be even more better if the front side of the CD was sharp, too. Just an idea.', '2005-01-30 07:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139878, 139565, 10858, '<td valign="top">I have the same phone type and the same provider. :-))) Great idea, though, the tilting of the table is a bit distracting, and the colour of the wall doesn''t help the mood. I hided it on both sides with my hands and I got a more moody result that way. I would improve lighting as well, more diffusion for the metals, because lighting is a bit harsh on them.</td>', 'I have the same phone type and the same provider. :-))) Great idea, though, the tilting of the table is a bit distracting, and the colour of the wall doesn''t help the mood. I hided it on both sides with my hands and I got a more moody result that way. I would improve lighting as well, more diffusion for the metals, because lighting is a bit harsh on them.', '2005-01-30 07:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139879, 139351, 10858, '<td valign="top">Loveable lights and moody colours! :-) I especially love the light circles on the dark blue background. For me, the leaf colours doesn''t really represent autumn, the new side of the subject is very much more accented, but alltogether a nice shot.</td>', 'Loveable lights and moody colours! :-) I especially love the light circles on the dark blue background. For me, the leaf colours doesn''t really represent autumn, the new side of the subject is very much more accented, but alltogether a nice shot.', '2005-01-30 07:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139882, 139887, 10858, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. :-) I miss the bottom of the flowers and you lost some shades of the whites. Maybe a little bit of underexposing would have helped and then you could have helped midtones and shadows with post-processing. I know these flowers and I had some troubles last year photographing the texture too, because harsh sun made it more difficult to get the best exposure for whites and darks at the same time. I wouldn''t have cropped it so tight on the right, tyou have cut off a part of that flower, but maybe I would have cropped a few cm on the top.</td>', 'Nice idea. :-) I miss the bottom of the flowers and you lost some shades of the whites. Maybe a little bit of underexposing would have helped and then you could have helped midtones and shadows with post-processing. I know these flowers and I had some troubles last year photographing the texture too, because harsh sun made it more difficult to get the best exposure for whites and darks at the same time. I wouldn''t have cropped it so tight on the right, tyou have cut off a part of that flower, but maybe I would have cropped a few cm on the top.', '2005-01-30 07:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139883, 138216, 10858, '<td valign="top">I don''t really like the colour tones here, somewhat it reminds me to a failed WB setup, or, if it was the purpose, it dowsn''t really give me the Matrix feeling. I would change your composition as well, for example a diagonal one with the keyboard, which divides your photo to two equal parts, one for old and one for new. I would choose a lower angle as well, approaching from the side of the pen. The idea is nice but could be implemented with a higher quality.</td>', 'I don''t really like the colour tones here, somewhat it reminds me to a failed WB setup, or, if it was the purpose, it dowsn''t really give me the Matrix feeling. I would change your composition as well, for example a diagonal one with the keyboard, which divides your photo to two equal parts, one for old and one for new. I would choose a lower angle as well, approaching from the side of the pen. The idea is nice but could be implemented with a higher quality.', '2005-01-30 07:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139884, 138837, 10858, '<td valign="top">I like the composition here. :-) I would crop a few mm on the top, because the signs of rotation have remained there. I would leave more space on the bottom, a few cm because the greens would add a nice colour element to the blue and terracotta colours. Maybe a bait more saturation would help, too. Try these, and I think you will get a very nice result. :-)</td>', 'I like the composition here. :-) I would crop a few mm on the top, because the signs of rotation have remained there. I would leave more space on the bottom, a few cm because the greens would add a nice colour element to the blue and terracotta colours. Maybe a bait more saturation would help, too. Try these, and I think you will get a very nice result. :-)', '2005-01-30 07:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139886, 139924, 10858, '<td valign="top">Composition is great, but I think overexposuring and WB has ruined your photo. Your models are so beautiful, shame you did this to this photo. :-(((</td>', 'Composition is great, but I think overexposuring and WB has ruined your photo. Your models are so beautiful, shame you did this to this photo. :-(((', '2005-01-30 07:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139887, 139086, 10858, '<td valign="top">Great composition, blue tones and I love the reflection. Both old and new are accented on your photo which is wonderful sharp. Personally I would have chosen black background, but this is just my taste, don''t care about it. :-)</td>', 'Great composition, blue tones and I love the reflection. Both old and new are accented on your photo which is wonderful sharp. Personally I would have chosen black background, but this is just my taste, don''t care about it. :-)', '2005-01-30 07:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139892, 139705, 10858, '<td valign="top">B&amp;W was a great choice here! Wonderful photo with full of emotions, I love the composition, and the contrast between old and young. :-) In Hungarian, new is rather for objects, not humans, but this may be just a language difference, so 10 from me and good luck!!!</td>', 'B&W was a great choice here! Wonderful photo with full of emotions, I love the composition, and the contrast between old and young. :-) In Hungarian, new is rather for objects, not humans, but this may be just a language difference, so 10 from me and good luck!!!', '2005-01-30 07:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139895, 139945, 10858, '<td valign="top">Not a 300*200 pixel photo again... :-( Are you people putting up so small photos driving me mad on purpose?!<br/> <br/>Nice idea and colours but it''s too small, the flower is unsharp, and old is not accented enough on your shot. Focusing on the not-yet-bloomed and dry flowers and shooting a macro would have been a better idea in my opinion, the unfocused blooming flower has a distracting effect on the story you wanted to tell me. Good idea, maybe presentation and quality will be better next time.</td>', 'Not a 300*200 pixel photo again... :-( Are you people putting up so small photos driving me mad on purpose?! Nice idea and colours but it''s too small, the flower is unsharp, and old is not accented enough on your shot. Focusing on the not-yet-bloomed and dry flowers and shooting a macro would have been a better idea in my opinion, the unfocused blooming flower has a distracting effect on the story you wanted to tell me. Good idea, maybe presentation and quality will be better next time.', '2005-01-30 07:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139896, 139832, 10858, '<td valign="top">Good catch of the subject! Shame for the shadow that takes too much off from your photo... You should have waited for the time when the whole church(?) would have been recflected beautiful. Always pay attention to not having big deatilless areas on your photo.</td>', 'Good catch of the subject! Shame for the shadow that takes too much off from your photo... You should have waited for the time when the whole church(?) would have been recflected beautiful. Always pay attention to not having big deatilless areas on your photo.', '2005-01-30 07:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139897, 139969, 10858, '<td valign="top">Creative! :-) I love this one playing with lights. Composition is great, shame for the shadow on the top left corner, I also would have left less space between the CF cards. But alltogether a nice shot.</td>', 'Creative! :-) I love this one playing with lights. Composition is great, shame for the shadow on the top left corner, I also would have left less space between the CF cards. But alltogether a nice shot.', '2005-01-30 07:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139898, 139975, 10858, '<td valign="top">I would have cropped on the bottom, and brought the new element to the front, too. This way it''s not accented enough for me. Seeing the background I am also not sure about WB here, I feel too much yellows in the shot.</td>', 'I would have cropped on the bottom, and brought the new element to the front, too. This way it''s not accented enough for me. Seeing the background I am also not sure about WB here, I feel too much yellows in the shot.', '2005-01-30 08:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139901, 138533, 10858, '<td valign="top">WoW! :-) B&amp;W VHS and colourful DVD! Nice implementation of the challenge! :-) The only one thing that distracts me a bit is the light satuff in the top right corner. I covered the top of the photo to get rid of it and I found the result better, try it. :-)</td>', 'WoW! :-) B&W VHS and colourful DVD! Nice implementation of the challenge! :-) The only one thing that distracts me a bit is the light satuff in the top right corner. I covered the top of the photo to get rid of it and I found the result better, try it. :-)', '2005-01-30 08:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139902, 138896, 10858, '<td valign="top">I think like this one, though I feel like background is a bit busy. I like the composition, DOF and the subject anyway. With a one coloured background this would be a nice submission, though, I appreciate the individuality of your photo.</td>', 'I think like this one, though I feel like background is a bit busy. I like the composition, DOF and the subject anyway. With a one coloured background this would be a nice submission, though, I appreciate the individuality of your photo.', '2005-01-30 08:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139904, 138702, 10858, '<td valign="top">I would crop from the left (just to keep the sailing boat) and I would show more of the old side. The bridge could be a key element on this photo, to get a semi-diagonal composition, it would divide the photo to the two parts. Old and new are opposites, so halved photo compositions work well with it, if you find a natural or artifical line that halves your photo, use it bravely to help the story you want to tell me! :-)</td>', 'I would crop from the left (just to keep the sailing boat) and I would show more of the old side. The bridge could be a key element on this photo, to get a semi-diagonal composition, it would divide the photo to the two parts. Old and new are opposites, so halved photo compositions work well with it, if you find a natural or artifical line that halves your photo, use it bravely to help the story you want to tell me! :-)', '2005-01-30 08:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139906, 139883, 10858, '<td valign="top">Not bad, maybe a bit overexposed (the building in the background), but it helps the opposite. For me, this shot cries for a symmetrical composition. Compose the "window" of the old one to the new to the center, if you feel the shot this way boring, rotate it it a bit, but leave it centered. Simple subjects need simple, but not ad-hoc compositions to work well. <br/> <br/>I see you din''t give a title. "Window to the new" or something like that came to my mind when I saw your shot. Feel your photo! If you couldn''t find a title, you didn''t feel it enough.</td>', 'Not bad, maybe a bit overexposed (the building in the background), but it helps the opposite. For me, this shot cries for a symmetrical composition. Compose the "window" of the old one to the new to the center, if you feel the shot this way boring, rotate it it a bit, but leave it centered. Simple subjects need simple, but not ad-hoc compositions to work well.  I see you din''t give a title. "Window to the new" or something like that came to my mind when I saw your shot. Feel your photo! If you couldn''t find a title, you didn''t feel it enough.', '2005-01-30 08:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139908, 138879, 10858, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but needs more improvement. B&amp;W usually works well for family photos that show us contrast and opposites, like here, old and young. I would improve sharpness: the baby is out of focus, though, I think it''s important for opposites to get both subjects clear and sharp. Very few out of focus opposites work well IMHO. Backround is busy, the door or wall or whatever is too bright and the person with the striped top is distracting, too. Shame you cut off the baby''s hands, for me, the composition would be working if I saw her (his?) hands, therefore I would have left more space on the right and bottom. The baby is looking at something in her (his?) hands and I miss this thing a much! And a more homogenic background, and focus on both characters. Maybe lighting didn''t help you with this candid shot, but it would have been important.</td>', 'Nice idea, but needs more improvement. B&W usually works well for family photos that show us contrast and opposites, like here, old and young. I would improve sharpness: the baby is out of focus, though, I think it''s important for opposites to get both subjects clear and sharp. Very few out of focus opposites work well IMHO. Backround is busy, the door or wall or whatever is too bright and the person with the striped top is distracting, too. Shame you cut off the baby''s hands, for me, the composition would be working if I saw her (his?) hands, therefore I would have left more space on the right and bottom. The baby is looking at something in her (his?) hands and I miss this thing a much! And a more homogenic background, and focus on both characters. Maybe lighting didn''t help you with this candid shot, but it would have been important.', '2005-01-30 08:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139909, 139069, 10858, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but I would have chosen a lower angle. For me, photographing exactly form the top is too direct for such an indirect composition of coins. I would have used a different background as well. Dark green or maroon velvet maybe, silver, gold and bronze hard metal always reminds me to the need of something soft and opposite colour. This might have added another nice element of opposites to the opposite of old and new. Just an idea.</td>', 'Nice idea, but I would have chosen a lower angle. For me, photographing exactly form the top is too direct for such an indirect composition of coins. I would have used a different background as well. Dark green or maroon velvet maybe, silver, gold and bronze hard metal always reminds me to the need of something soft and opposite colour. This might have added another nice element of opposites to the opposite of old and new. Just an idea.', '2005-01-30 08:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139911, 138819, 10858, '<td valign="top">The idea is great! The background is too busy and therefore distracting. I also feel WB problems here. I would show more of the text on the old bottle and I miss the top of the bottles very much. This subject cries for a portrait crop. I think noone needed these bottles anymore, in your shoes I would have taken them home to make a nice composition. I would have filled them with Coke as well, but at least the new one. Use diffused light for glass, because reflections can be very distracting and cause overexposed areas sometimes.</td>', 'The idea is great! The background is too busy and therefore distracting. I also feel WB problems here. I would show more of the text on the old bottle and I miss the top of the bottles very much. This subject cries for a portrait crop. I think noone needed these bottles anymore, in your shoes I would have taken them home to make a nice composition. I would have filled them with Coke as well, but at least the new one. Use diffused light for glass, because reflections can be very distracting and cause overexposed areas sometimes.', '2005-01-30 08:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139913, 138642, 31443, '<td valign="top">Not a very old hand, sweet photo....</td>', 'Not a very old hand, sweet photo....', '2005-01-30 08:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139914, 139555, 10858, '<td valign="top">I think the old clock is more beautiful than the new one, therefore I am a bit disappointed to find it out of focus. The lighting is harsh on the metal of the new (use diffused lighting for metals), but I like the composition. I would have left more space all around, this way it''s a abit tight for me. Just a cm on all sides. And more DOF. The old clock is too interesting to push it out of focus, IMHO.</td>', 'I think the old clock is more beautiful than the new one, therefore I am a bit disappointed to find it out of focus. The lighting is harsh on the metal of the new (use diffused lighting for metals), but I like the composition. I would have left more space all around, this way it''s a abit tight for me. Just a cm on all sides. And more DOF. The old clock is too interesting to push it out of focus, IMHO.', '2005-01-30 08:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139917, 139853, 31443, '<td valign="top">I feel really old now........great composition though</td>', 'I feel really old now........great composition though', '2005-01-30 08:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139918, 139988, 10858, '<td valign="top">Great subject! I wouldn''t have cropped the bottom of the electronic dictionary, but I might have cropped a bit on the top, because the cover of the books leads my eyes to unused depths of the photo. The background could be better, black velvet would work well with the warm brown tones of the book and the silver metal of the electronic dictionary. I love old and beautiful books like this, and the photo coul dbe even more dramatic if it were a Longman dictionary, too. :-)</td>', 'Great subject! I wouldn''t have cropped the bottom of the electronic dictionary, but I might have cropped a bit on the top, because the cover of the books leads my eyes to unused depths of the photo. The background could be better, black velvet would work well with the warm brown tones of the book and the silver metal of the electronic dictionary. I love old and beautiful books like this, and the photo coul dbe even more dramatic if it were a Longman dictionary, too. :-)', '2005-01-30 08:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139919, 138642, 10858, '<td valign="top">Wonderful soft photo, with loveable colour tones! My only problem is that the mother''s hangd doesn''t look that old at all, I think, grandma''s hand would have helped the opposite here more. I like the emotions of the photo a much.</td>', 'Wonderful soft photo, with loveable colour tones! My only problem is that the mother''s hangd doesn''t look that old at all, I think, grandma''s hand would have helped the opposite here more. I like the emotions of the photo a much.', '2005-01-30 08:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139922, 139542, 10858, '<td valign="top">I would like this one with full colours. The natural colours of the stone bridge and nature would be opposing enough with the unnatural reds of the new bridge. Composition is great and the subject is loveable, too. I am very curious about the full-coloured version, because personally I think making pastel colours for the yet desaturated elements would have made your shot better. This way it''s a bit agressive for me. If it was the purpose, it works well, but be careful with selective desaturation. I love this technique, too, anyway. :-)</td>', 'I would like this one with full colours. The natural colours of the stone bridge and nature would be opposing enough with the unnatural reds of the new bridge. Composition is great and the subject is loveable, too. I am very curious about the full-coloured version, because personally I think making pastel colours for the yet desaturated elements would have made your shot better. This way it''s a bit agressive for me. If it was the purpose, it works well, but be careful with selective desaturation. I love this technique, too, anyway. :-)', '2005-01-30 08:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139923, 139497, 10858, '<td valign="top">Nice candid with lovely emotions and I like the composition. :-) Shin tones could be improved... But where is the opposite of old and new?</td>', 'Nice candid with lovely emotions and I like the composition. :-) Shin tones could be improved... But where is the opposite of old and new?', '2005-01-30 08:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139924, 138508, 31443, '<td valign="top">The one on the left is JFK but the other?? Clinton?? Great shot like the bronze look</td>', 'The one on the left is JFK but the other?? Clinton?? Great shot like the bronze look', '2005-01-30 08:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139925, 139954, 10858, '<td valign="top">Great idea, but what you have done to the lightbulb stuff is a disaster. The candle is overexposed, too and out of focus... Sorry, but I feel too much useless artifical elements in your photo that doesn''t help the story you wanted to tell, evenmore they ruined your photo... :-(((</td>', 'Great idea, but what you have done to the lightbulb stuff is a disaster. The candle is overexposed, too and out of focus... Sorry, but I feel too much useless artifical elements in your photo that doesn''t help the story you wanted to tell, evenmore they ruined your photo... :-(((', '2005-01-30 08:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139926, 139594, 10858, '<td valign="top">I love these colours: reds, greens and whites together! Nice composition, and a good example for opposites working well when one part is out of focus. Whites could be more clear, expecially in the bottom left corner, and it''s a bit overexposed on the right side, but alltogether nice one.</td>', 'I love these colours: reds, greens and whites together! Nice composition, and a good example for opposites working well when one part is out of focus. Whites could be more clear, expecially in the bottom left corner, and it''s a bit overexposed on the right side, but alltogether nice one.', '2005-01-30 08:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139929, 139515, 10858, '<td valign="top">I would levae more space on the right, the side of the church could start from the right bottom corner. I wouldn''t have deaturated the church, what colour it was? Grey? Brown? Red? Yellow? I think it would have worked well with the blues, but maybe I am mistaken. Composition is great! :-) The view, too. :-)</td>', 'I would levae more space on the right, the side of the church could start from the right bottom corner. I wouldn''t have deaturated the church, what colour it was? Grey? Brown? Red? Yellow? I think it would have worked well with the blues, but maybe I am mistaken. Composition is great! :-) The view, too. :-)', '2005-01-30 08:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139931, 139556, 10858, '<td valign="top">I would have used a square crop, I think negative space is useless here, and I would put a bit more space on the right. But, wonderful tones and colours, I love them! Getting rid of the dust would have made this one more effective and clear.</td>', 'I would have used a square crop, I think negative space is useless here, and I would put a bit more space on the right. But, wonderful tones and colours, I love them! Getting rid of the dust would have made this one more effective and clear.', '2005-01-30 08:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139933, 139107, 10858, '<td valign="top">Great viewpoint and composition. :-) You didn''t have luck with the weather, though. The photo is a bit greyish, maybe a bit contrast and saturation would help, I am not sure.</td>', 'Great viewpoint and composition. :-) You didn''t have luck with the weather, though. The photo is a bit greyish, maybe a bit contrast and saturation would help, I am not sure.', '2005-01-30 08:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139937, 138508, 10858, '<td valign="top">Very nice shades and sharpness! What I don''t really like, it''s composition. I feel like it wanted to be somewhat a bit chaotical (cropped coins), but there are too much rules in thiscomposition: coins visible on the top in a ruled row... It''s diffiult to make chaos that looks good, but I think it would help the mood. Don''t misunderstand me, I think this is a nice photo, I just wonder how to make it more better. :-)</td>', 'Very nice shades and sharpness! What I don''t really like, it''s composition. I feel like it wanted to be somewhat a bit chaotical (cropped coins), but there are too much rules in thiscomposition: coins visible on the top in a ruled row... It''s diffiult to make chaos that looks good, but I think it would help the mood. Don''t misunderstand me, I think this is a nice photo, I just wonder how to make it more better. :-)', '2005-01-30 08:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139941, 139213, 10858, '<td valign="top">MY ABSOLUTE FAVOURITE so far!!! So wonderfully exposed, beautiful colours and composition! I love the gold tones against the pyramids silverish tones, the classical old and beautiful architecture against the way too simple and unfriendly new, the elegant mood of this shot and the tones of the sky and ground, the long-exposured lights as stars which add a nice element to the gloom of these buildings. Stunning! I have been there, but I have never seen Le Louvre sooo beautiful...<br/> <br/>This is my pick for the blue! Good luck, absolutely 10!!!</td>', 'MY ABSOLUTE FAVOURITE so far!!! So wonderfully exposed, beautiful colours and composition! I love the gold tones against the pyramids silverish tones, the classical old and beautiful architecture against the way too simple and unfriendly new, the elegant mood of this shot and the tones of the sky and ground, the long-exposured lights as stars which add a nice element to the gloom of these buildings. Stunning! I have been there, but I have never seen Le Louvre sooo beautiful... This is my pick for the blue! Good luck, absolutely 10!!!', '2005-01-30 08:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139945, 138008, 10858, '<td valign="top">Oh, yes, a sunset. :-) There are too much blacks without details, and it''s hard to find our what''s this - anyway, sharp - silhouette exactly without the title. I can''t see the implementation of the challenge, where is old and new on this photo?</td>', 'Oh, yes, a sunset. :-) There are too much blacks without details, and it''s hard to find our what''s this - anyway, sharp - silhouette exactly without the title. I can''t see the implementation of the challenge, where is old and new on this photo?', '2005-01-30 09:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139981, 139749, 31133, '<td valign="top">Really beautiful post-processing. I''d love to know how you did this.  What you''ve done with the light is amazing. The only tiny thing negative I can say is that the frame is too thick for me. This is a good shot to show off with a very thin frame or none at all. The windmills in the background complete this shot.</td>', 'Really beautiful post-processing. I''d love to know how you did this.  What you''ve done with the light is amazing. The only tiny thing negative I can say is that the frame is too thick for me. This is a good shot to show off with a very thin frame or none at all. The windmills in the background complete this shot.', '2005-01-30 10:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139983, 138194, 31133, '<td valign="top">Nice angle and nice crop.</td>', 'Nice angle and nice crop.', '2005-01-30 10:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139985, 139985, 31133, '<td valign="top">The detail of the older building seems much better than that of the newer. The super-tight crop emphasises the wonderful angles / lines you''ve chosen. Just wish the new building were as sharp as the old one. 8</td>', 'The detail of the older building seems much better than that of the newer. The super-tight crop emphasises the wonderful angles / lines you''ve chosen. Just wish the new building were as sharp as the old one. 8', '2005-01-30 10:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139986, 138473, 31133, '<td valign="top">This has beautiful colors and sharpness (except maybe on the green jigger).  Something''s missing (maybe the "wow" factor?) for me though - I''m sorry I can''t be more constructive - I''m really trying.  6</td>', 'This has beautiful colors and sharpness (except maybe on the green jigger).  Something''s missing (maybe the "wow" factor?) for me though - I''m sorry I can''t be more constructive - I''m really trying.  6', '2005-01-30 10:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139988, 138804, 31133, '<td valign="top">Looks like effort was put into getting the pencil / pen angles just right. A little USM and a little less red tone would''ve been nice, but this is a nice composition anyway. 6</td>', 'Looks like effort was put into getting the pencil / pen angles just right. A little USM and a little less red tone would''ve been nice, but this is a nice composition anyway. 6', '2005-01-30 10:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139991, 139760, 31133, '<td valign="top">This is a great idea that fits the challenge wonderfully. Times sure have changed! The pen could use a little more sharpness, but the Word screen couldn''t be better.</td>', 'This is a great idea that fits the challenge wonderfully. Times sure have changed! The pen could use a little more sharpness, but the Word screen couldn''t be better.', '2005-01-30 10:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139996, 139641, 31133, '<td valign="top">I gave this a low score because it''s blurry it lacks appeal for me, particularly related to the challenge.  I do notice that the centering and the color are good, though.</td>', 'I gave this a low score because it''s blurry it lacks appeal for me, particularly related to the challenge.  I do notice that the centering and the color are good, though.', '2005-01-30 10:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140077, 139923, 10858, '<td valign="top">Great composition and effect on this photo! I don''t like that much effected photos, but it works well here. :-) Good luck!</td>', 'Great composition and effect on this photo! I don''t like that much effected photos, but it works well here. :-) Good luck!', '2005-01-30 11:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140078, 139676, 10858, '<td valign="top">I think this is too small for me to be able to decide whether it would be good or not. Nice composition, but quite unsharp, and way to small. I can''t really catch the opposite of old and new this way, maybe if it was bigger.</td>', 'I think this is too small for me to be able to decide whether it would be good or not. Nice composition, but quite unsharp, and way to small. I can''t really catch the opposite of old and new this way, maybe if it was bigger.', '2005-01-30 11:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140081, 139570, 10858, '<td valign="top">Nice ida and composition. :-) I feel though WB problems here, too much reds and yellows. I would have used a dark background to highlight the light tones of the coins and the credit card.</td>', 'Nice ida and composition. :-) I feel though WB problems here, too much reds and yellows. I would have used a dark background to highlight the light tones of the coins and the credit card.', '2005-01-30 12:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140082, 139816, 13113, '<td valign="top">That is neat, it would b better if there wasn''t anything behind it but hey that is my choice of a good picture. Great job though!</td>', 'That is neat, it would b better if there wasn''t anything behind it but hey that is my choice of a good picture. Great job though!', '2005-01-30 12:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140086, 139624, 10858, '<td valign="top">Nice smoke, but the glass on the bottom, the wall and the other objects are a bit distracting. The opposite of old and new is not accented enough in my opinion...</td>', 'Nice smoke, but the glass on the bottom, the wall and the other objects are a bit distracting. The opposite of old and new is not accented enough in my opinion...', '2005-01-30 12:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140089, 139518, 13113, '<td valign="top">Yeah, I can notice the old one, this is very nice and very thoughtful for those banana lovers, well what would be cool is if the old one was rotton but that is my choice of a nice photo. Grear job, I don''t see anything wrong with it. 9</td>', 'Yeah, I can notice the old one, this is very nice and very thoughtful for those banana lovers, well what would be cool is if the old one was rotton but that is my choice of a nice photo. Grear job, I don''t see anything wrong with it. 9', '2005-01-30 12:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
