(1140096, 139678, 13113, '<td valign="top">LOL! This would be better if you were taking a New (clean ) knife and then using that to break the surface of the peanut butter instead of the finger but I like the idea though.</td>', 'LOL! This would be better if you were taking a New (clean ) knife and then using that to break the surface of the peanut butter instead of the finger but I like the idea though.', '2005-01-30 12:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
