(1140135, 138841, 10858, '<td valign="top">Please, don''t use flash when photographing pets!!! It harms their eyes! <br/> <br/>The idea is nice, but the background is too busy and the dogs too much out of focus. I don''t find any conscious composition or lighting, and colours are pale a bit, too. Use of flash in pets eyes needs to be avoided!</td>', 'Please, don''t use flash when photographing pets!!! It harms their eyes!  The idea is nice, but the background is too busy and the dogs too much out of focus. I don''t find any conscious composition or lighting, and colours are pale a bit, too. Use of flash in pets eyes needs to be avoided!', '2005-01-30 12:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
