(1140481, 138706, 28619, '<td valign="top">One of several ''Ghurkin'' shots I''ve come across in this challenge but this one is by far my favourite.<br/> <br/>You can almost feel the tension between the new and the old as if the new tower is intimidating the old with it''s size and technical superiority.</td>', 'One of several ''Ghurkin'' shots I''ve come across in this challenge but this one is by far my favourite. You can almost feel the tension between the new and the old as if the new tower is intimidating the old with it''s size and technical superiority.', '2005-01-30 17:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140483, 139766, 28619, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid this will suffer as it is so similar to other entries.<br/> <br/>The main subject looks a bit out of focus and those two little marks on the background are distracting.  As you couldn''t clone them out because of basic editing rules, you perhaps should have spent a little time setting up the shot to get it just right.</td>', 'I''m afraid this will suffer as it is so similar to other entries. The main subject looks a bit out of focus and those two little marks on the background are distracting.  As you couldn''t clone them out because of basic editing rules, you perhaps should have spent a little time setting up the shot to get it just right.', '2005-01-30 17:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
