(1140579, 139992, 28619, '<td valign="top">Although the idea is a bit ''obvious'' and very similar to many other entries, this one really stands out from the crowd.<br/> <br/>The composition really grabs me and the placement of the sleek, shiny iPod against the busy clutter of the CDs draws my eye nicely.</td>', 'Although the idea is a bit ''obvious'' and very similar to many other entries, this one really stands out from the crowd. The composition really grabs me and the placement of the sleek, shiny iPod against the busy clutter of the CDs draws my eye nicely.', '2005-01-30 18:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140584, 139976, 28619, '<td valign="top">Maybe I am being pedantic but that spelling mistake in the title really annoys me.<br/> <br/>The idea and the image don''t annoy me at all though, I like both.  Imaginative take on the challenge theme.</td>', 'Maybe I am being pedantic but that spelling mistake in the title really annoys me. The idea and the image don''t annoy me at all though, I like both.  Imaginative take on the challenge theme.', '2005-01-30 18:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140586, 138008, 28619, '<td valign="top">Nice enough but where''s the old &amp; new???  This one is going to tank I''m afraid.</td>', 'Nice enough but where''s the old & new???  This one is going to tank I''m afraid.', '2005-01-30 18:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140590, 139258, 28619, '<td valign="top">Title says bright colours but they are not bright on my monitor, looks very dark.<br/> <br/>If the old vs. new is the crayons then I think it is a weak link to the challenge theme.</td>', 'Title says bright colours but they are not bright on my monitor, looks very dark. If the old vs. new is the crayons then I think it is a weak link to the challenge theme.', '2005-01-30 18:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140593, 139966, 28619, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm... another coin picture.  Might suffer due to the similarity to many other entries.<br/> <br/>The trouble is, when your entry is so similar to so many other you have a harder time standing out from the crowd.</td>', 'Hmmmm... another coin picture.  Might suffer due to the similarity to many other entries. The trouble is, when your entry is so similar to so many other you have a harder time standing out from the crowd.', '2005-01-30 18:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140598, 139944, 32659, '<td valign="top">Is it supposed to be smoke around the gun? It''s a bit distracting.</td>', 'Is it supposed to be smoke around the gun? It''s a bit distracting.', '2005-01-30 18:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140600, 138925, 28619, '<td valign="top">I am the most pedantic man on the planet so I can''t ignore the fact that the windmill is not for generating power but for drawing water.  This sort of spoils the idea behind the picture for me.<br/> <br/>The picture itself is well done, I like the composition and the crop.</td>', 'I am the most pedantic man on the planet so I can''t ignore the fact that the windmill is not for generating power but for drawing water.  This sort of spoils the idea behind the picture for me. The picture itself is well done, I like the composition and the crop.', '2005-01-30 18:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140603, 138806, 28619, '<td valign="top">One of the best coin pictures from this challenge.<br/> <br/>You''ve done a great job with the lighting there and I like the reflections.  Tough to get right with only basic editing but you pulled it off. 7</td>', 'One of the best coin pictures from this challenge. You''ve done a great job with the lighting there and I like the reflections.  Tough to get right with only basic editing but you pulled it off. 7', '2005-01-30 18:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140608, 138863, 28619, '<td valign="top">I find myself looking at this and thinking ''Huh, what IS this?''.  Not necessarily a bad thing in a photograph but in this case it just doesn''t work.<br/> <br/>The challenge theme just isn''t there for me.</td>', 'I find myself looking at this and thinking ''Huh, what IS this?''.  Not necessarily a bad thing in a photograph but in this case it just doesn''t work. The challenge theme just isn''t there for me.', '2005-01-30 18:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140610, 138879, 28619, '<td valign="top">The person in the background is distracting and the blown out area a little overpowering.<br/> <br/>Baby is not in sharp focus and you can''t see her eyes.  Babies have the most amazing eyes and I find that if you don''t capture them you lose the emotion.  In this case maybe that''s not so important as it is a more candid type shot and not a portrait but I still find myself wishing I could see her eyes a bit better.</td>', 'The person in the background is distracting and the blown out area a little overpowering. Baby is not in sharp focus and you can''t see her eyes.  Babies have the most amazing eyes and I find that if you don''t capture them you lose the emotion.  In this case maybe that''s not so important as it is a more candid type shot and not a portrait but I still find myself wishing I could see her eyes a bit better.', '2005-01-30 18:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140611, 139556, 28619, '<td valign="top">I find the ''speckles'' on the surface very distracting.</td>', 'I find the ''speckles'' on the surface very distracting.', '2005-01-30 18:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140616, 139853, 28619, '<td valign="top">When your entry is so similar to a dozen others you really have to nail it to make it stand out from the crowd.  Unfortunatley, I don''t think you quite nailed it this time.<br/> <br/>The biggest problem I can see is that the old-looking machine in the background is actually a CD player with a digital display which sort of detracts from the theme - it''s not old enough.</td>', 'When your entry is so similar to a dozen others you really have to nail it to make it stand out from the crowd.  Unfortunatley, I don''t think you quite nailed it this time. The biggest problem I can see is that the old-looking machine in the background is actually a CD player with a digital display which sort of detracts from the theme - it''s not old enough.', '2005-01-30 18:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140618, 139624, 28619, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot and a subtle take on the theme, maybe too subtle.</td>', 'Beautiful shot and a subtle take on the theme, maybe too subtle.', '2005-01-30 18:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140634, 139911, 28619, '<td valign="top">Excuse me for being so blunt, but this looks too much like poo and I think it will suffer because of that.  I''m not being nasty, but really, that''s my first reaction when viewing this.</td>', 'Excuse me for being so blunt, but this looks too much like poo and I think it will suffer because of that.  I''m not being nasty, but really, that''s my first reaction when viewing this.', '2005-01-30 19:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140637, 139989, 28619, '<td valign="top">I wish the crop wasn''t so tight at the bottom but this a great capture which fits the theme very well indeed.</td>', 'I wish the crop wasn''t so tight at the bottom but this a great capture which fits the theme very well indeed.', '2005-01-30 19:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140651, 139617, 28619, '<td valign="top">My aim is to vote on every entry in this challenge.  I''ve done 56% so far which is 137 images.  I swear I''m seeing iPods in my sleep!!<br/> <br/>What I mean by that is this is very similar to a number of other image but at least you had imagination enough to contrast the iPod with something other than a record.<br/> <br/>I think that when your entry is similar to others it is much harder making it stand out from the crowd.</td>', 'My aim is to vote on every entry in this challenge.  I''ve done 56% so far which is 137 images.  I swear I''m seeing iPods in my sleep!! What I mean by that is this is very similar to a number of other image but at least you had imagination enough to contrast the iPod with something other than a record. I think that when your entry is similar to others it is much harder making it stand out from the crowd.', '2005-01-30 19:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140653, 139674, 28619, '<td valign="top">I like this one, very evocative feel to it and a nice composition.</td>', 'I like this one, very evocative feel to it and a nice composition.', '2005-01-30 19:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140659, 139468, 28619, '<td valign="top">Lots of coin entries in this challenge and I''m afraid your doesn''t really stand out from the crowd well enough.<br/> <br/>When your entry is so similar to so many others you really have to do something special to mark yours out as different and I don''t think it''s special enough.<br/> <br/>Good lighting though.  Must be tough to get the lighting right without being overwhelmed with bright reflections.</td>', 'Lots of coin entries in this challenge and I''m afraid your doesn''t really stand out from the crowd well enough. When your entry is so similar to so many others you really have to do something special to mark yours out as different and I don''t think it''s special enough. Good lighting though.  Must be tough to get the lighting right without being overwhelmed with bright reflections.', '2005-01-30 19:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140663, 138761, 28619, '<td valign="top">I''ll be blunt here.  It is one of my pet hates when someone gives a photo the title of the challenge.  Surely you could have come up with SOMETHING other than old &amp; new.<br/> <br/>The image itself is great.  I love the lighting, very moody.  The camera strap adds interest and colour.  I love the picture on the phone too, it really adds to the theme.<br/> <br/>One of the best ''old camera vs new camera'' entries I have seen so far.  Gets my 7, but would be an 8 if it weren''t for that title, sorry!</td>', 'I''ll be blunt here.  It is one of my pet hates when someone gives a photo the title of the challenge.  Surely you could have come up with SOMETHING other than old & new. The image itself is great.  I love the lighting, very moody.  The camera strap adds interest and colour.  I love the picture on the phone too, it really adds to the theme. One of the best ''old camera vs new camera'' entries I have seen so far.  Gets my 7, but would be an 8 if it weren''t for that title, sorry!', '2005-01-30 19:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140670, 139532, 28619, '<td valign="top">Lovely old church.  Since moving to Australia from the UK one of the few things I miss is old buildings like this.<br/> <br/>The picture comes across as a bit ''flat'' to me though and doesn''t really hit my spot for some reason.  I think this would have been nicer if you got it early morning or at dusk when the light was more favourable.</td>', 'Lovely old church.  Since moving to Australia from the UK one of the few things I miss is old buildings like this. The picture comes across as a bit ''flat'' to me though and doesn''t really hit my spot for some reason.  I think this would have been nicer if you got it early morning or at dusk when the light was more favourable.', '2005-01-30 19:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140674, 139954, 28619, '<td valign="top">I have to be honest and say that I really don''t like the oversaturated effect you''ve gone for here.</td>', 'I have to be honest and say that I really don''t like the oversaturated effect you''ve gone for here.', '2005-01-30 19:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140677, 139184, 28619, '<td valign="top">I love the muted colours of the green bottles.</td>', 'I love the muted colours of the green bottles.', '2005-01-30 19:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140679, 139814, 28619, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the border at all.  I would like the head of the rusty screw to be in sharper focus and the extreme shallow DOF is a bit overdone for my liking.</td>', 'I don''t like the border at all.  I would like the head of the rusty screw to be in sharper focus and the extreme shallow DOF is a bit overdone for my liking.', '2005-01-30 19:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140681, 139086, 28619, '<td valign="top">Certainly stands out from the crowd of vinyl vs. CD entries.  I love the reflection idea, so much better than just plonking them next to each other on the table and snapping away.</td>', 'Certainly stands out from the crowd of vinyl vs. CD entries.  I love the reflection idea, so much better than just plonking them next to each other on the table and snapping away.', '2005-01-30 19:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140686, 139709, 28619, '<td valign="top">Just a bit boring I feel.  Has a snapshot feel to it.</td>', 'Just a bit boring I feel.  Has a snapshot feel to it.', '2005-01-30 19:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140734, 139842, 32070, '<td valign="top">original idea.... great photo..... <br/>would have been a little more identifiable if you had used an official PS2 controller rather than a 3rd Party... but that does not detract from the actual photography at all..</td>', 'original idea.... great photo..... would have been a little more identifiable if you had used an official PS2 controller rather than a 3rd Party... but that does not detract from the actual photography at all..', '2005-01-30 20:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140739, 139616, 32070, '<td valign="top">the fact that the wood is out of focus adds to the contrast rather than taking away from the picture quality... well done..</td>', 'the fact that the wood is out of focus adds to the contrast rather than taking away from the picture quality... well done..', '2005-01-30 20:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
