(1140762, 139641, 31606, '<td valign="top">I like this.  You have to look hard to see it and I like a shot that I have to look at to see it all.  Looking at a shot longer makes me appreciate it more. 9</td>', 'I like this.  You have to look hard to see it and I like a shot that I have to look at to see it all.  Looking at a shot longer makes me appreciate it more. 9', '2005-01-30 20:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
