(1140814, 138284, 26518, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  The person is well placed, interesting angles and lighting.  Top Notch Stuff.</td>', 'Very nice shot.  The person is well placed, interesting angles and lighting.  Top Notch Stuff.', '2005-01-30 21:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
