(1145802, 138505, 27431, '<td valign="top">I see a lot of simulariies between you. Congratulations on a very original shot. My only nit-pick would be a deeper depth of field, too have you in focus as well as the photo of your dad.</td>', 'I see a lot of simulariies between you. Congratulations on a very original shot. My only nit-pick would be a deeper depth of field, too have you in focus as well as the photo of your dad.', '2005-02-02 05:00:53.000000', NULL, 0),
