(1145821, 138958, 30861, '<td valign="top">Heida''s cat, eh? Damned good thing it didn''t ribbon, then, or there''d be a REAL conspiracy posse on the warpath. <br/> <br/>To those who don''t see "new" and "old" here, what is a kitten if not new? And the scale is ancient...</td>', 'Heida''s cat, eh? Damned good thing it didn''t ribbon, then, or there''d be a REAL conspiracy posse on the warpath.  To those who don''t see "new" and "old" here, what is a kitten if not new? And the scale is ancient...', '2005-02-02 05:11:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(1145822, 139964, 26450, '<td valign="top">good job</td>', 'good job', '2005-02-02 05:12:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(1145825, 139816, 27524, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all votes and comments.<br/>For those who didnt understood what it is... its one of those modern city instalations...some plastic with print on it.</td>', 'Thanks for all votes and comments.For those who didnt understood what it is... its one of those modern city instalations...some plastic with print on it.', '2005-02-02 05:13:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(1145832, 139213, 32885, '<td valign="top">I like the photo. Great composition and subject. Well done.</td>', 'I like the photo. Great composition and subject. Well done.', '2005-02-02 05:16:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(1145844, 139556, 19333, '<td valign="top">Well, I was wrong!!<br/> <br/>I expected some chatting about the spot an everything went about the dust on the glass... eeeerrr! it isn''t dust, it isn''t even a glass!!!<br/>The surface is metallic black finished, similar to a car, and all the specks are because of this surface finish.<br/> <br/>I must admit I didn''t see the "dust" knowing what it was, but after all the comments I feel it may have turned the score down a little. I''ll try to be more open minder next time :)<br/> <br/>Regarding the crop some of you have mentioned, I tried some others but ended liking this one the better. To me the diagonal compensates the negative space leading the eyes to the subject. Maybe a little tighter on the left...<br/> <br/>Thank you all for your comments, they''re truly appreciated.</td>', 'Well, I was wrong!! I expected some chatting about the spot an everything went about the dust on the glass... eeeerrr! it isn''t dust, it isn''t even a glass!!!The surface is metallic black finished, similar to a car, and all the specks are because of this surface finish. I must admit I didn''t see the "dust" knowing what it was, but after all the comments I feel it may have turned the score down a little. I''ll try to be more open minder next time :) Regarding the crop some of you have mentioned, I tried some others but ended liking this one the better. To me the diagonal compensates the negative space leading the eyes to the subject. Maybe a little tighter on the left... Thank you all for your comments, they''re truly appreciated.', '2005-02-02 05:25:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(1145901, 139756, 11929, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all your comments, since its my first challenge (and the shot wasn''t what i was looking for - the open windows, the clouds) i am very proud to be in the top 30.<br/> <br/>Some outtakes  <a href="//www.avatartek.com/foto/OldAndNew" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.avatartek.com/foto/OldAndNew</a> <br/> <br/></td>', 'Thanks to all your comments, since its my first challenge (and the shot wasn''t what i was looking for - the open windows, the clouds) i am very proud to be in the top 30. Some outtakes  //www.avatartek.com/foto/OldAndNew  ', '2005-02-02 06:13:33.000000', NULL, 0),
