(1145985, 140009, 29513, '<td valign="top">Wow, 10th place!  I really like the distortion of the relfection.  Just the way my memory works; exagerating some aspects and minimizing others.  I did not notice the distortion in the thumbnail so it was a very pleasant surprise in the full shot.</td>', 'Wow, 10th place!  I really like the distortion of the relfection.  Just the way my memory works; exagerating some aspects and minimizing others.  I did not notice the distortion in the thumbnail so it was a very pleasant surprise in the full shot.', '2005-02-02 07:17:54.000000', NULL, 0),
