(1146136, 139990, 25095, '<td valign="top">Apparently it was difficult for people to see that the NEW martini glass is standing on OLD washed glass.  Your title says Martini a hyphen then Glass...stating they are two different things.  I think it was a great idea, sorry more didn''t get it.</td>', 'Apparently it was difficult for people to see that the NEW martini glass is standing on OLD washed glass.  Your title says Martini a hyphen then Glass...stating they are two different things.  I think it was a great idea, sorry more didn''t get it.', '2005-02-02 08:59:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(1146141, 139882, 25095, '<td valign="top">A little too much of a stretch for most of us.  Need a more "to the point" photo.  Good attempt.</td>', 'A little too much of a stretch for most of us.  Need a more "to the point" photo.  Good attempt.', '2005-02-02 09:01:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(1146167, 138841, 25095, '<td valign="top">I would suggest a shot of them together maybe sitting with very good light so you don''t have to worry about a flash.  Since your beginning a studio is probably not available but those lights would help a lot with their fur color and with the cameras inability to focus sharply on them.  It would also get rid of the cluttered background.  You could hang a light colored sheet over the edge of the table for a backdrop and open windows and turn on lights.<br/> <br/>Keep trying, you''ll get it.</td>', 'I would suggest a shot of them together maybe sitting with very good light so you don''t have to worry about a flash.  Since your beginning a studio is probably not available but those lights would help a lot with their fur color and with the cameras inability to focus sharply on them.  It would also get rid of the cluttered background.  You could hang a light colored sheet over the edge of the table for a backdrop and open windows and turn on lights. Keep trying, you''ll get it.', '2005-02-02 09:08:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(1146263, 138491, 31760, '<td valign="top">I wanted to thank everyone for your comments, I am learning slowly but surely and your comments do help!</td>', 'I wanted to thank everyone for your comments, I am learning slowly but surely and your comments do help!', '2005-02-02 09:31:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(1146276, 138442, 24846, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot. She''ll enjoy this later in life. Would have been a great"pink" submission as well.</td>', 'Lovely shot. She''ll enjoy this later in life. Would have been a great"pink" submission as well.', '2005-02-02 09:33:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(1146340, 138642, 7889, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all your comments. The picture is not out of focus but was taken with a Photax Soft Focus filter. The hands belong to my Grandson Luke and my wife Granny Pam! Thanks again.<br/> <br/>Mike<br/></td>', 'Thanks for all your comments. The picture is not out of focus but was taken with a Photax Soft Focus filter. The hands belong to my Grandson Luke and my wife Granny Pam! Thanks again. Mike', '2005-02-02 09:51:27.000000', NULL, 0),
