(1146913, 139755, 13879, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your 17th place!<br/> <br/>I was going to take EXACTLY the same picture, but i couldnt get down to swansea town-centre in time.  I am really glad someone did though &amp; did so well.  (i gave you a 10)<br/> <br/>Happy Snapping<br/>MARK</td>', 'Congrats on your 17th place! I was going to take EXACTLY the same picture, but i couldnt get down to swansea town-centre in time.  I am really glad someone did though & did so well.  (i gave you a 10) Happy SnappingMARK', '2005-02-02 13:48:57.000000', NULL, 0),
