(1148582, 138829, 31403, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments, I learned a lot on this one.<br/> <br/>I''m not sure how clear I was on my initial comments.  Salt Lake City is in a valley that gets "capped" during the winter, and smog builds up until the next storm comes through.  This was shot on the second day of this build up.  I went back the next morning to shoot in different light, and I couldn''t see the building in the background at all.<br/> <br/>I''ve also learned that DPC doesn''t like close crops.  The entire tower in the front is shown, I just liked it using all of the vertical space, so it''s cropped tight.<br/> <br/>Thanks again for the comments,</td>', 'Thanks for the comments, I learned a lot on this one. I''m not sure how clear I was on my initial comments.  Salt Lake City is in a valley that gets "capped" during the winter, and smog builds up until the next storm comes through.  This was shot on the second day of this build up.  I went back the next morning to shoot in different light, and I couldn''t see the building in the background at all. I''ve also learned that DPC doesn''t like close crops.  The entire tower in the front is shown, I just liked it using all of the vertical space, so it''s cropped tight. Thanks again for the comments,', '2005-02-03 09:22:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(1148713, 139213, 8367, '<td valign="top">Congratulations! An excellent photo. Well done!</td>', 'Congratulations! An excellent photo. Well done!', '2005-02-03 10:56:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(1149231, 139214, 14221, '<td valign="top">How did you get this shot?  Were you allowed access to a roof or was this shot out of a window from another bldg on campus?<br/> <br/>Really nice use of zoom to get the building in focus.</td>', 'How did you get this shot?  Were you allowed access to a roof or was this shot out of a window from another bldg on campus? Really nice use of zoom to get the building in focus.', '2005-02-03 15:50:02.000000', NULL, 0),
