(1166454, 138863, 28930, '<td valign="top"><br/>Lonely at the Top?<br/> <br/>Damn, I guess most people just DON''T get IT.<br/> <br/>If the picture is something readably identifiable and completely unoriginal, people seem to love it. <br/> <br/>I mean two of the top three images are of the SAME subject. Not even spectacular work I must say, gee, just set up a tripod and open the shutter for about 20 seconds on a building - WOW. Totally amazing I am sure.<br/> <br/>I love ranking low, as most people are idiots, so I must be doing something right!!!<br/> <br/>THANKS to those few that actually appreciate my image!<br/> <br/>- The Macronaut<br/> <br/></td>', 'Lonely at the Top? Damn, I guess most people just DON''T get IT. If the picture is something readably identifiable and completely unoriginal, people seem to love it.  I mean two of the top three images are of the SAME subject. Not even spectacular work I must say, gee, just set up a tripod and open the shutter for about 20 seconds on a building - WOW. Totally amazing I am sure. I love ranking low, as most people are idiots, so I must be doing something right!!! THANKS to those few that actually appreciate my image! - The Macronaut ', '2005-02-13 15:47:16.000000', NULL, 0),
