(1186816, 138640, 32276, '<td valign="top">I figured I would add my own notes on this picture. It was originally going to be a set shot with the two hands joined together. Well, dealing with a 1 year old has its problems sometimes. So this is actually a small piece of a larger picture of my son crawling up his grandmothers lap. But dont tell her this was "old and new." :)<br/> <br/>And if you look in the upper right hand corner, that is actually his mother''s hand holding him in place.<br/> <br/>To be honest, I got really lucky with this one.<br/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-02-21 16:58:41.</i></td>', 'I figured I would add my own notes on this picture. It was originally going to be a set shot with the two hands joined together. Well, dealing with a 1 year old has its problems sometimes. So this is actually a small piece of a larger picture of my son crawling up his grandmothers lap. But dont tell her this was "old and new." :) And if you look in the upper right hand corner, that is actually his mother''s hand holding him in place. To be honest, I got really lucky with this one.', '2005-02-21 16:57:14.000000', '2005-02-21 16:58:41.000000', 0),
