(1207154, 138863, 9581, '<td valign="top">Hey dont give up because I want to see more of your of your ideas and work. Not to mention we need more people with your attitude and skill level of photography here then maybe soon I will start getting better scores as my own skills progress with my out of the box ideas. Ideas like these are the ones that are going places in the market of advertising today. So please dont give up I look forward to seeing more of your work:)</td>', 'Hey dont give up because I want to see more of your of your ideas and work. Not to mention we need more people with your attitude and skill level of photography here then maybe soon I will start getting better scores as my own skills progress with my out of the box ideas. Ideas like these are the ones that are going places in the market of advertising today. So please dont give up I look forward to seeing more of your work:)', '2005-03-04 05:14:54.000000', NULL, 0),
